Output~2025-04-06 23:34:49.570116: [RequestOutput(request_id=2, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the political system in India. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 5054, 1887, 304, 6890, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="India is a federal parliamentary democratic republic with a multi-party system. The country has a complex political system, which is a blend of parliamentary democracy and federalism. Here's an overview:\n\n**Parliamentary System:**\n\nIndia has a parliamentary system of government, where the head of government is the Prime Minister, who is responsible to the legislature (Parliament). The Prime Minister is appointed by the President, who is the head of state, but the President's role is largely ceremonial. The Prime Minister is the leader of the political party or coalition that has the majority in the Lok Sabha (Lower House of Parliament).\n\n**Federalism:**\n\nIndia is a federal state with a three-tier system of government: the Union Government, State Governments, and Local Governments. The Union Government is responsible for matters of national importance, such as defense, foreign policy, and currency, while the State Governments have jurisdiction over matters like law and order, education, and healthcare. The Local Governments, comprising municipalities, panchayats, and zilla parishads, are responsible for local administration and development.\n\n**Multi-Party System:**\n\nIndia has a multi-party system, with numerous political parties contesting elections. The two main national parties are the Indian National Congress (INC) and the Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP). There are also several regional parties, such as the Dravida Munnetra Kazhagam (DMK) in Tamil Nadu and the Trinamool Congress (TMC) in West Bengal. The party or coalition with the majority in the Lok Sabha forms the government, and the leader of that party becomes the Prime Minister.\n\n**Elections:**\n\nElections are held every five years to elect members to the Lok Sabha and the Rajya Sabha (Upper House of Parliament). The elections are conducted by the Election Commission of India, an independent body. The voting system is based on the first-past-the-post system, where the candidate with the most votes in a constituency wins.\n\n**Checks and Balances:**\n\nThe Indian political system has several checks and balances to ensure accountability and transparency. The judiciary, comprising the Supreme Court and High Courts, has the power to interpret laws and ensure that they are in line with the Constitution. The media and civil society organizations also play a crucial role in holding the government accountable.\n\nIn summary, India's political system is a complex blend of parliamentary democracy, federalism, and multi-party system, with a system of checks and balances to ensure accountability and transparency.", token_ids=[34648, 374, 264, 6918, 44250, 26623, 35544, 449, 264, 7447, 24993, 1887, 13, 578, 3224, 706, 264, 6485, 5054, 1887, 11, 902, 374, 264, 20955, 315, 44250, 20095, 323, 6918, 2191, 13, 5810, 596, 459, 24131, 1473, 334, 4368, 12685, 661, 744, 25, 57277, 34648, 706, 264, 44250, 1887, 315, 3109, 11, 1405, 279, 2010, 315, 3109, 374, 279, 12801, 9675, 11, 889, 374, 8647, 311, 279, 39856, 320, 4368, 12685, 570, 578, 12801, 9675, 374, 21489, 555, 279, 4900, 11, 889, 374, 279, 2010, 315, 1614, 11, 719, 279, 4900, 596, 3560, 374, 14090, 93642, 13, 578, 12801, 9675, 374, 279, 7808, 315, 279, 5054, 4717, 477, 26283, 430, 706, 279, 8857, 304, 279, 58501, 87564, 320, 9230, 4783, 315, 20302, 3677, 334, 57853, 2191, 25, 57277, 34648, 374, 264, 6918, 1614, 449, 264, 2380, 58355, 1887, 315, 3109, 25, 279, 9323, 10423, 11, 3314, 88799, 11, 323, 8949, 88799, 13, 578, 9323, 10423, 374, 8647, 369, 13146, 315, 5426, 12939, 11, 1778, 439, 9232, 11, 7362, 4947, 11, 323, 11667, 11, 1418, 279, 3314, 88799, 617, 29101, 927, 13146, 1093, 2383, 323, 2015, 11, 6873, 11, 323, 18985, 13, 578, 8949, 88799, 11, 46338, 59589, 11, 281, 3581, 352, 1900, 11, 323, 1167, 6374, 52297, 7819, 11, 527, 8647, 369, 2254, 8735, 323, 4500, 382, 334, 20981, 12, 38461, 744, 25, 57277, 34648, 706, 264, 7447, 24993, 1887, 11, 449, 12387, 5054, 9875, 14130, 287, 16374, 13, 578, 1403, 1925, 5426, 9875, 527, 279, 7904, 5165, 8151, 320, 39539, 8, 323, 279, 67692, 9491, 7911, 4448, 460, 8722, 320, 15327, 47, 570, 2684, 527, 1101, 3892, 15481, 9875, 11, 1778, 439, 279, 2999, 402, 4849, 28982, 4816, 969, 36074, 71, 351, 309, 320, 8561, 42, 8, 304, 44883, 75905, 323, 279, 1183, 258, 309, 1786, 8151, 320, 51, 11865, 8, 304, 4410, 50120, 13, 578, 4717, 477, 26283, 449, 279, 8857, 304, 279, 58501, 87564, 7739, 279, 3109, 11, 323, 279, 7808, 315, 430, 4717, 9221, 279, 12801, 9675, 382, 334, 36, 68779, 25, 57277, 36, 68779, 527, 5762, 1475, 4330, 1667, 311, 4135, 3697, 311, 279, 58501, 87564, 323, 279, 26291, 7911, 87564, 320, 14585, 4783, 315, 20302, 570, 578, 16374, 527, 13375, 555, 279, 26838, 9849, 315, 6890, 11, 459, 9678, 2547, 13, 578, 16043, 1887, 374, 3196, 389, 279, 1176, 2320, 561, 10826, 25414, 1887, 11, 1405, 279, 9322, 449, 279, 1455, 12973, 304, 264, 65739, 15160, 382, 334, 50920, 323, 19984, 3095, 25, 57277, 791, 7904, 5054, 1887, 706, 3892, 12621, 323, 39954, 311, 6106, 39242, 323, 28330, 13, 578, 72975, 11, 46338, 279, 13814, 7301, 323, 5234, 66563, 11, 706, 279, 2410, 311, 14532, 7016, 323, 6106, 430, 814, 527, 304, 1584, 449, 279, 18039, 13, 578, 3772, 323, 8431, 8396, 11351, 1101, 1514, 264, 16