ative solutions to complex technical problems\n* Communicate effectively with team members and stakeholders to explain technical issues and solutions\n* Prioritize tasks and manage multiple projects simultaneously\n* Stay up-to-date with the latest technologies and advancements in the field\n\nOverall, excellent problem-solving skills are essential for an Aerospace Engineer to design, develop, and test complex systems and ensure the safety and efficiency of aircraft, spacecraft, and missiles.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 459, 3187, 315, 264, 2683, 1405, 9250, 3575, 99246, 7512, 527, 7718, 1473, 334, 12524, 11106, 25, 81965, 29483, 57277, 2170, 459, 81965, 29483, 11, 499, 1053, 387, 8647, 369, 30829, 11, 11469, 11, 323, 7649, 14467, 11, 42640, 11, 323, 34441, 13, 2057, 25555, 304, 420, 3560, 11, 499, 1053, 1205, 311, 617, 9250, 3575, 99246, 7512, 311, 23075, 6485, 11156, 11774, 323, 6106, 279, 7296, 323, 15374, 315, 279, 11731, 382, 8538, 10507, 315, 3575, 99246, 9256, 499, 2643, 13123, 304, 420, 3560, 2997, 1473, 9, 42782, 65, 51340, 4819, 449, 14467, 6067, 11, 1778, 439, 10873, 11, 91228, 11, 477, 10758, 6067, 198, 9, 81745, 323, 7649, 502, 14769, 369, 14467, 6956, 11, 1778, 439, 27296, 11, 21787, 11, 477, 20948, 14787, 198, 9, 38527, 20994, 828, 505, 11213, 7177, 311, 10765, 323, 4495, 5178, 4819, 198, 9, 49681, 1113, 449, 1023, 25175, 323, 53459, 311, 9006, 6485, 11156, 5435, 198, 9, 81745, 323, 25976, 10105, 311, 8108, 12248, 11, 48913, 11, 323, 20748, 505, 14467, 271, 1271, 387, 6992, 304, 420, 3560, 11, 499, 1053, 1205, 311, 387, 3025, 311, 1473, 9, 38527, 3059, 6485, 828, 323, 10765, 12912, 323, 18845, 198, 9, 8000, 11782, 10105, 311, 6485, 11156, 5435, 198, 9, 16838, 349, 13750, 449, 2128, 3697, 323, 39210, 311, 10552, 11156, 4819, 323, 10105, 198, 9, 32499, 27406, 9256, 323, 10299, 5361, 7224, 25291, 198, 9, 29837, 709, 4791, 18920, 449, 279, 5652, 14645, 323, 83787, 304, 279, 2115, 271, 28589, 11, 9250, 3575, 99246, 7512, 527, 7718, 369, 459, 81965, 29483, 311,