Output~2025-04-06 23:35:53.980634: [RequestOutput(request_id=20, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: What should a customer do if they want to return a product ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 3639, 1288, 264, 6130, 656, 422, 814, 1390, 311, 471, 264, 2027, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="**Returning a Product: A Step-by-Step Guide**\n\nIf you're not completely satisfied with your purchase, we want to make it easy for you to return it. Here's a simple process to follow:\n\n**Step 1: Check the Return Policy**\n\nBefore initiating a return, please review our return policy to ensure you're eligible for a return. You can find our return policy on our website or by contacting our customer service team.\n\n**Step 2: Gather the Necessary Information**\n\nTo initiate a return, you'll need the following information:\n\n* Your order number\n* The reason for the return\n* The product(s) you'd like to return\n\n**Step 3: Contact Our Customer Service Team**\n\nReach out to our customer service team via phone, email, or live chat to initiate the return process. We're available to assist you Monday to Friday, 9am to 5pm EST. Our team will guide you through the return process and provide a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number.\n\n**Step 4: Package the Product**\n\nCarefully package the product(s) you'd like to return in their original packaging, if possible. Make sure to include all original accessories, manuals, and tags.\n\n**Step 5: Ship the Product**\n\nShip the package back to us using a trackable shipping method. Please note that you're responsible for the cost of return shipping.\n\n**Step 6: Receive Your Refund**\n\nOnce we receive and inspect the returned product, we'll process your refund within 5-7 business days. Refunds will be issued in the original form of payment.\n\n**Important Notes:**\n\n* Returns must be initiated within 30 days of delivery.\n* Products must be in their original condition with all original packaging and accessories.\n* Refunds may be subject to a restocking fee, depending on the product and reason for return.\n\nIf you have any questions or concerns about our return policy or process, please don't hesitate to contact our customer service team. We're here to help!", token_ids=[334, 85914, 264, 5761, 25, 362, 15166, 14656, 12, 8468, 13002, 57277, 2746, 499, 2351, 539, 6724, 20097, 449, 701, 7782, 11, 584, 1390, 311, 1304, 433, 4228, 369, 499, 311, 471, 433, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 4382, 1920, 311, 1833, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 4343, 279, 3494, 11216, 57277, 10438, 79516, 264, 471, 11, 4587, 3477, 1057, 471, 4947, 311, 6106, 499, 2351, 17446, 369, 264, 471, 13, 1472, 649, 1505, 1057, 471, 4947, 389, 1057, 3997, 477, 555, 47208, 1057, 6130, 2532, 2128, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 50095, 279, 95633, 8245, 57277, 1271, 39201, 264, 471, 11, 499, 3358, 1205, 279, 2768, 2038, 1473, 9, 4718, 2015, 1396, 198, 9, 578, 2944, 369, 279, 471, 198, 9, 578, 2027, 1161, 8, 499, 4265, 1093, 311, 471, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 9359, 5751, 12557, 5475, 8068, 57277, 49468, 704, 311, 1057, 6130, 2532, 2128, 4669, 4641, 11, 2613, 11, 477, 3974, 6369, 311, 39201, 279, 471, 1920, 13, 1226, 2351, 2561, 311, 7945, 499, 7159, 311, 6740, 11, 220, 24, 309, 311, 220, 20, 5298, 26963, 13, 5751, 2128, 690, 8641, 499, 1555, 279, 471, 1920, 323, 3493, 264, 3494, 66125, 31770, 31662, 320, 49, 4940, 8, 1396, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 17333, 279, 5761, 57277, 33099, 3725, 6462, 279, 2027, 1161, 8, 499, 4265,