Output~2025-04-06 23:40:27.181613: [RequestOutput(request_id=125, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Suggest two questions suitable for uncovering potential customer needs ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 328, 3884, 1403, 4860, 14791, 369, 45063, 287, 4754, 6130, 3966, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are two questions that can help uncover potential customer needs:\n\n1. "What are the biggest challenges you\'re currently facing in [specific area of interest or industry], and how are you currently addressing them?"\n\nThis question helps to identify the customer\'s pain points and understand their current solutions, which can reveal potential needs that may not be being met. By asking about the challenges they\'re facing, you can gain insight into their goals, motivations, and frustrations, and tailor your solution to address those specific needs.\n\n2. "What are your goals and objectives for [specific area of interest or industry], and how do you envision achieving them?"\n\nThis question helps to uncover the customer\'s aspirations and expectations, and can reveal potential needs that may not be immediately apparent. By asking about their goals and objectives, you can gain insight into their vision for the future and identify potential gaps or obstacles that may be hindering their progress. This can help you tailor your solution to meet their needs and help them achieve their goals.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 1403, 4860, 430, 649, 1520, 4506