Output~2025-04-06 23:40:39.977286: [RequestOutput(request_id=128, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Restrict the article to within 250 words ### Input: Particle Physics: An Overview ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 42427, 858, 279, 4652, 311, 2949, 220, 5154, 4339, 17010, 5688, 25, 36954, 28415, 25, 1556, 35907, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a rewritten version of the article, condensed to 250 words or less:\n\nParticle physics is a branch of physics that studies the behavior of fundamental particles, which are the building blocks of matter and radiation. These particles are the smallest units of matter that retain the properties of a particular element, and they are the basic constituents of all matter.\n\nThe most well-known particles are the quarks and leptons, which make up protons, neutrons, and electrons. Quarks are the building blocks of protons and neutrons, while leptons are the building blocks of electrons. Other particles, such as photons, W and Z bosons, and gluons, play important roles in the interactions between quarks and leptons.\n\nParticle physics is concerned with understanding the properties and interactions of these particles, as well as the forces that govern their behavior. The strong nuclear force, weak nuclear force, and electromagnetic force are the three fundamental forces that govern the interactions between particles.\n\nParticle physics has led to many important discoveries, including the existence of antimatter, the discovery of the Higgs boson, and the understanding of the structure of the nucleus. The Large Hadron Collider (LHC) is a powerful tool used to study particle physics, colliding protons at incredibly high energies to create new particles and gain insights into the fundamental nature of matter and the universe.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 59624, 2373, 315, 279, 4652, 11, 75826, 311, 220, 5154, 4339, 477, 2753, 1473, 30108, 22027, 374, 264, 9046, 315, 22027, 430, 7978, 279, 7865, 315, 16188, 19252, 11, 902, 527, 279, 4857, 10215, 315, 5030, 323, 25407, 13, 4314, 19252, 527, 279, 25655, 8316, 315, 5030, 430, 14389, 279, 6012, 315, 264, 4040, 2449, 11, 323, 814, 527, 279, 6913, 51720, 315, 682, 5030, 382, 791, 1455, 1664, 22015, 19252, 527, 279, 934, 7341, 323, 95540, 2439, 11, 902, 1304, 709, 463, 35511, 11, 26878, 26692, 11, 323, 57678, 13, 3489, 7341, 527, 279, 4857, 10215, 315, 463, 35511, 323, 26878, 26692, 11, 1418, 95540, 2439, 527, 279, 4857, 10215, 315, 57678, 13, 7089, 19252, 11, 1778, 439, 89235, 11, 468, 323, 1901, 43746, 2439, 11, 323, 78376, 2439, 11, 1514, 3062, 13073, 304, 279, 22639, 1990, 934, 7341, 323, 95540, 2439, 382, 30108, 22027, 374, 11920, 449, 8830, 279, 6012, 323, 22639, 315, 1521, 19252, 11, 439, 1664, 439, 279, 8603, 430, 2633, 872, 7865, 13, 578, 3831, 11499, 5457, 11, 7621, 11499, 5457, 11, 323, 66669, 5457, 527, 279, 2380, 16188, 8603, 430, 2633, 279, 22639, 1990, 19252, 382, 30108, 22027, 706, 6197, 311, 1690, 3062, 54098, 11, 2737, 279, 14209, 315, 79312, 1683, 11, 279, 18841, 315, 279, 473, 62247, 43746, 263, 11, 323, 279, 8830, 315, 279, 6070, 315, 279, 62607, 13, 578, 20902, 24805, 2298, 74921, 320, 43, 23263, 8, 374, 264, 8147, 5507, 1511, 311, 4007, 19320, 22027, 11, 4631, 6714, 463, 35511, 520, 17235, 1579, 49969, 311, 1893, 502, 19252, 323, 8895, 26793, 1139, 279, 16188, 7138, 315, 5030, 323, 279, 15861, 13, 12800