Output~2025-04-06 23:41:17.093056: [RequestOutput(request_id=143, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{\'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a creative story that starts with the phrase "The sun was setting in the west". ### Response:\'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 11782, 3446, 430, 8638, 449, 279, 17571, 330, 791, 7160, 574, 6376, 304, 279, 9909, 3343, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='The sun was setting in the west, casting a warm orange glow over the small town of Willow Creek. The sky was painted with hues of pink and purple, a breathtaking sight that never failed to take Emma\'s breath away. She stood at the edge of the cliff, her feet dangling over the edge, feeling the gentle breeze rustle her hair.\n\nAs she gazed out at the landscape, Emma\'s mind wandered back to the day she had moved to Willow Creek. She had left behind the hustle and bustle of city life, seeking a quieter, more peaceful existence. And she had found it here, in this charming town surrounded by rolling hills and dense forests.\n\nAs the sun dipped lower in the sky, Emma noticed a figure making their way up the winding path that led to the cliff. It was a young man, his dark hair messy and his eyes fixed intently on the ground. Emma watched as he approached, his pace slow and deliberate.\n\nAs he reached the edge of the cliff, he looked up and caught Emma\'s eye. For a moment, they just stared at each other, the only sound the distant chirping of crickets and the rustling of leaves. Then, without a word, the young man sat down beside Emma, his eyes still fixed on the view.\n\nEmma felt a sense of calm wash over her as she gazed out at the sunset with this stranger by her side. They sat in silence for a long time, the only sound the gentle lapping of the waves against the shore below.\n\nAs the sun dipped below the horizon, the young man turned to Emma and smiled. "My name is Max," he said, his voice low and smooth. "And you are?"\n\nEmma smiled back, feeling a sense of connection to this stranger that she couldn\'t explain. "I\'m Emma," she replied, her voice barely above a whisper.\n\nAs the stars began to twinkle in the night sky, Emma and Max sat together, watching the world slow down and come alive with magic. They talked long into the night, sharing stories and laughter, their hearts beating in perfect harmony.\n\nAnd as the night wore on, Emma knew that she had found something special in this small town, something that she would never have found in the city. She had found a sense of peace, a sense of belonging, and a sense of wonder that she would carry with her for the rest of her life.', token_ids=[791, 7160, 574, 6376, 304, 279, 9909, 11, 25146, 264, 8369, 19087, 37066, 927, 279, 2678, 6424, 315, 65449, 24076, 13, 578, 13180, 574, 24937, 449, 82757, 315, 18718, 323, 25977, 11, 264, 57192, 14254, 430, 2646, 4745, 311, 1935, 36035, 596, 11745, 3201, 13, 3005, 14980, 520, 279, 6964, 315, 279, 44106, 11, 1077, 7693, 92723, 927, 279, 6964, 11, 8430, 279, 22443, 46385, 23941, 273, 1077, 7013, 382, 2170, 1364, 342, 28109, 704, 520, 279, 18921, 11, 36035, 596, 4059, 82294, 1203, 311, 279, 1938, 1364, 1047, 7882, 311, 65449, 24076, 13, 3005, 1047, 2163, 4920, 279, 88312, 323, 21444, 273, 315, 3363, 2324, 11, 11125, 264, 90845, 11, 810, 26733, 14209, 13, 1628, 1364, 1047, 1766, 433, 1618, 11, 304, 420, 35509, 6424, 23712, 555, 20700, 35231, 323, 29050, 36658, 382, 2170, 279, 7160, 73307, 4827, 304, 279, 13180, 11, 36035, 14000, 264, 7216, 3339, 872, 1648, 709, 279