Output~2025-04-06 23:41:44.893340: [RequestOutput(request_id=161, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate three pieces of advice for navigating a long-distance relationship. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 2380, 9863, 315, 9650, 369, 60499, 264, 1317, 74908, 5133, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here are three pieces of advice for navigating a long-distance relationship:\n\n**1. Communicate openly and regularly**: Communication is key to any successful relationship, and it's especially important when you're apart. Make time to talk to each other every day, whether it's a quick phone call, video chat, or text message. Share your thoughts, feelings, and experiences with each other, and actively listen to what the other person has to say. This will help you stay connected and prevent misunderstandings from building up.\n\n**2. Set realistic expectations and boundaries**: Long-distance relationships can be challenging, and it's essential to set realistic expectations about what you can and can't do. Discuss your schedules, work commitments, and personal goals with each other, and make sure you're both on the same page. Establishing boundaries will help you avoid feelings of resentment and frustration, and allow you to focus on the positive aspects of your relationship.\n\n**3. Make time for shared activities and rituals**: Even though you're apart, you can still share experiences and create special moments together. Schedule regular video game nights, watch the same TV show or movie, or cook a meal together over video call. These shared activities will help you feel more connected and create a sense of closeness, even from a distance. Additionally, establish special rituals, such as sending each other love notes or surprise gifts, to keep the spark alive and show your love and appreciation for each other.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 2380, 9863, 315, 9650, 369, 60499, 264, 1317, 74908, 5133, 1473, 334, 16, 13, 16838, 349, 30447, 323, 15870, 96618, 31966, 374, 1401, 311, 904, 6992, 5133, 11, 323, 433, 596, 5423, 3062, 994, 499, 2351, 10980, 13, 7557, 892, 311, 3137, 311, 1855, 1023, 1475, 1938, 11, 3508, 433, 596, 264, 4062, 4641, 1650, 11, 2835, 6369, 11, 477, 1495, 1984, 13, 12037, 701, 11555, 11, 16024, 11, 323, 11704, 449, 1855, 1023, 11, 323, 22815, 9020, 311, 1148, 279, 1023, 1732, 706, 311, 2019, 13, 1115, 690, 1520, 499, 4822, 8599, 323, 5471, 90700, 826, 505, 4857, 709, 382, 334, 17, 13, 2638, 26569, 17078, 323, 23546, 96618, 5843, 74908, 12135, 649, 387, 17436, 11, 323, 433, 596, 7718, 311, 743, 26569, 17078, 922, 1148, 499, 649, 323, 649, 956, 656, 13, 66379, 701, 37869, 11, 990, 42356, 11, 323, 4443, 9021, 449, 1855, 1023, 11, 323, 1304, 2771, 499, 2351, 2225, 389, 279, 1890, 2199, 13, 40498, 287, 23546, 690, 1520, 499, 5766, 16024, 315, 71654, 323, 33086, 11, 323, 2187, 499, 311, 5357, 389, 279, 6928, 13878, 315, 701, 5133, 382, 334, 18, 13, 7557, 892, 369, 6222, 7640, 323, 57679, 96618, 7570, 3582, 499, 2351, 10980, 11, 499, 649, 2103, 4430, 11704, 323, 1893, 3361, 14269, 3871, 13, 24416, 5912, 2835, 1847, 22178, 11, 3821, 279, 1890, 6007, 1501, 477, 5818, 11, 477, 4394, 264, 15496, 3871, 927, 2835, 1650, 13, 4314, 6222, 7640, 690, 1520, 499, 2733, 810, 8599, 323, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 4597, 24639, 11, 1524, 505, 264, 6138, 13, 23212, 11, 5813, 3361, 57679, 11, 1778, 439, 11889, 1855, 1023, 3021, 8554, 477, 13051, 21258, 11, 311, 2567, 279, 15541, 13989, 323, 1501, 701, 3021, 323, 3599