brands and celebrities, including McDonald\'s, Disney, and Taylor Swift.\n\nOverall, Coca-Cola is a beloved beverage that has become an integral part of popular culture. Its iconic bottle design and memorable advertising campaigns have made it a recognizable brand around the world.', token_ids=[34, 17270, 66277, 374, 264, 12782, 660, 8579, 7172, 430, 374, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 15324, 323, 27073, 47497, 304, 279, 1917, 13, 578, 7172, 574, 36592, 304, 220, 9367, 21, 555, 3842, 69383, 37733, 11, 264, 90394, 304, 20005, 11, 16272, 11, 323, 574, 15453, 61149, 439, 264, 330, 54160, 99305, 323, 20207, 43450, 1, 430, 1436, 27208, 55403, 323, 48839, 36709, 382, 791, 4113, 11363, 369, 63954, 66277, 574, 264, 15499, 64263, 6367, 11, 719, 433, 374, 3967, 311, 6782, 33165, 323, 42819, 32523, 11, 439, 1664, 439, 49750, 13, 578, 7172, 6288, 6244, 5526, 304, 279, 3723, 4273, 323, 9041, 311, 1023, 5961, 2212, 279, 1917, 13, 11450, 11, 63954, 66277, 374, 2561, 304, 927, 220, 1049, 5961, 323, 374, 832, 315, 279, 1455, 15525, 16097, 304, 279, 1917, 382, 34, 17270, 66277, 706, 264, 35947, 12945, 430, 374, 3629, 7633, 439, 10437, 323, 10284, 26242, 13, 578, 7172, 374, 11383, 10434, 85042, 323, 374, 3629, 27073, 449, 264, 16363, 315, 30564, 477, 42819, 13, 1102, 374, 1101, 2561, 304, 264, 8205, 315, 32523, 11, 2737, 27304, 74362, 11, 45805, 74362, 11, 323, 66682, 74362, 382, 644, 5369, 311, 1202, 27373, 43450, 11, 279, 63954, 66277, 8351, 374, 1101, 3967, 369, 1202, 8661, 323, 13172, 9045, 13, 578, 2883, 706, 1511, 264, 8205, 315, 33596, 78101, 927, 279, 1667, 11, 2737, 330, 791, 50756, 3011, 30107, 288, 1, 323, 330, 51, 5642, 279, 74658, 1210, 578, 2883, 706, 1101, 53319, 449, 264, 1396, 315, 5526, 16097, 323, 40501, 11, 2737, 32014, 596, 11, 16795, 11, 323, 16844, 24594, 382, 28589, 11, 63954, 66277, 374, 264, 28530, 43450, 430, 706, 3719, 459, 26154, 961, 315, 5526, 7829, 13, 11699, 27373, 16893, 2955, 323, 33596, 13172, 21343, 617, 1903, 433, 264, 66352, 6883, 2212, 279, 1917, 13, 1280