self-control, often used to describe someone who remains peaceful and composed in the face of adversity.\n9. **Meditation**: This practice is often associated with achieving a state of inner peace and calmness, promoting mental clarity and focus.\n10. **Solace**: This word conveys a sense of comfort and peace, often used to describe finding solace in a difficult or challenging situation.\n\nThese ideas all share a common thread of promoting a sense of calmness, serenity, and tranquility, which are all essential components of the theme "Peace".', token_ids=[3923, 264, 11364, 7057, 0, 5810, 527, 1063, 6848, 430, 527, 4528, 311, 279, 7057, 330, 85743, 52518, 16, 13, 3146, 27588, 65527, 96618, 1115, 7434, 374, 15499, 5552, 311, 9096, 11, 82003, 279, 4623, 315, 1694, 304, 26306, 449, 3885, 323, 279, 1917, 2212, 603, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 50, 17848, 488, 96618, 1115, 3492, 390, 50369, 264, 5647, 315, 19858, 2136, 323, 41664, 1429, 11, 902, 374, 3629, 5938, 449, 26733, 22484, 323, 5415, 315, 4059, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 1305, 276, 447, 1429, 96618, 22196, 311, 1446, 56685, 11, 41664, 1429, 24897, 264, 1614, 315, 26733, 2136, 323, 11594, 2136, 11, 3629, 24895, 555, 264, 5647, 315, 2103, 2136, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 34, 7828, 2136, 96618, 1115, 4623, 24400, 389, 279, 19821, 315, 63355, 477, 65858, 11, 6968, 459, 16975, 315, 26733, 2136, 323, 20334, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 50, 39513, 96618, 1115, 7434, 374, 3629, 1511, 311, 7664, 2574, 430, 4546, 6981, 323, 43685, 11, 1778, 439, 264, 65464, 62684, 477, 264, 78729, 4676, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 28671, 768, 96618, 763, 264, 1917, 10409, 449, 12248, 11, 21847, 649, 387, 264, 8147, 7891, 315, 9096, 11, 14393, 264, 4545, 315, 11594, 39471, 367, 323, 22599, 627, 22, 13, 3146, 24205, 2136, 96618, 1115, 4623, 66159, 279, 19821, 315, 7351, 477, 5820, 11, 6968, 264, 5647, 315, 26733, 2136, 323, 20334, 627, 23, 13, 3146, 1110, 12313, 96618, 1115, 7434, 24897, 264, 1614, 315, 19858, 2136, 323, 659, 4565, 11, 3629, 1511, 311, 7664, 4423, 889, 8625, 26733, 323