 is typically used in classification problems where the model is trained to predict the probability of each class given the input data.\n\nOverall, this model architecture is well-suited for image classification tasks, where the convolutional layers are used to extract features from the input images and the fully connected layer is used to make a classification decision based on those features.', token_ids=[791, 1646, 18112, 17610, 315, 264, 56812, 278, 30828, 4009, 320, 56555, 8, 8272, 555, 264, 7373, 8599, 30828, 4009, 13, 578, 20352, 13651, 315, 279, 1646, 17610, 315, 3116, 56812, 278, 13931, 11, 1855, 315, 902, 17208, 264, 743, 315, 4048, 481, 13711, 311, 279, 1988, 828, 311, 8819, 4519, 13, 578, 2612, 315, 1855, 56812, 278, 6324, 374, 5946, 1555, 264, 1050, 24115, 15449, 734, 311, 19678, 2536, 8614, 10981, 382, 791, 2612, 315, 279, 11999, 56812, 278, 6324, 374, 1243, 68461, 323, 5946, 1555, 264, 7373, 8599, 6324, 11, 902, 374, 264, 29050, 30828, 4009, 6324, 449, 264, 3544, 1396, 315, 34313, 13, 578, 7373, 8599, 6324, 374, 1511, 311, 4726, 1920, 279, 28532, 4519, 323, 10772, 1124, 369, 24790, 382, 24901, 11, 279, 2612, 315, 279, 7373, 8599, 6324, 374, 5946, 1555, 264, 77469, 6324, 11, 902, 374, 264, 955, 315, 15449, 734, 430, 16674, 264, 19463, 8141, 927, 682, 3284, 6989, 13, 1115, 374, 11383, 1511, 304, 24790, 5435, 1405, 279, 1646, 374, 16572, 311, 7168, 279, 19463, 315, 1855, 538, 2728, 279, 1988, 828, 382, 28589, 11, 420, 1646, 18112, 374, 1664, 87229, 1639, 369, 2217, 24790, 9256, 11, 1405, 279, 56812, 278, 13931, 527, 1511, 311, 8819, 4519, 505, 279, 1988, 5448, 323, 279, 7373, 8599, 6324, 374, 1511, 311, 1304, 264, 24790, 5597, 3196, 389, 1884, 4519, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
