, Mountain Peak and Sky Blue, work together to create a sense of balance and harmony, evoking the natural beauty of the mountain range.\n* The secondary colors, Rocky Terrain and Forest Green, add texture and depth to the palette, while also representing the natural environment.\n* The accent colors, Golden Haze and Deep Shadow, add a sense of warmth and dimension to the design, drawing the viewer\'s attention to specific elements on the page.\n\nThis color palette is designed to evoke a sense of serenity and natural beauty, perfect for a website that features a stunning photo of a mountain range in the background.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 7754, 11, 358, 4265, 387, 6380, 311, 1520, 1893, 264, 2587, 1933, 27404, 369, 264, 3997, 449, 264, 6685, 315, 264, 16700, 2134, 304, 279, 4092, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 12090, 1933, 27404, 1473, 334, 1668, 67509, 25, 330, 92269, 8409, 56685, 1, 57277, 334, 6334, 9718, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 92269, 44262, 334, 30183, 23, 33, 26491, 22, 1680, 362, 8369, 11, 9578, 88, 14198, 1933, 430, 3721, 8099, 279, 55883, 10651, 315, 279, 16700, 40035, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 47048, 8868, 334, 30183, 4044, 2152, 8428, 1680, 362, 8579, 11, 78729, 6437, 430, 41255, 279, 95863, 16975, 315, 279, 16700, 2134, 596, 13180, 382, 334, 50063, 9718, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 36152, 88, 63118, 334, 30183, 26281, 33, 410, 1680, 362, 60121, 11, 9578, 88, 2579, 1481, 4935, 1933, 430, 11105, 279, 56617, 25911, 315, 279, 24405, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 50678, 7997, 334, 30183, 18, 36, 23, 36, 3174, 1680, 362, 60121, 11, 78343, 88, 6307, 430, 11621, 264, 5916, 315, 5933, 13444, 311, 279, 27404, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 63385, 88, 71541, 334, 30183, 29421, 1680, 362, 10748, 4251, 1933, 430, 11105, 279, 12056, 1824, 5795, 40035, 315, 279, 24405, 382, 334, 62466, 9718, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 60890, 473, 10033, 334, 30183, 37, 22, 5744, 21, 37, 1680, 362, 8369, 11, 21411, 1933, 430, 11621, 264, 5647, 315, 41463, 323, 8149, 311, 279, 27404, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 34564, 25284, 334, 3018