r until the waffles are golden brown and crispy.\n9. Repeat with the remaining batter, greasing the waffle iron with cooking spray or oil as needed.\n10. Serve the waffles hot with your favorite toppings, such as fresh fruit, nuts, seeds, or nut butter.\n\n**Tips and Variations:**\n\n* Use different flavors of protein powder to change up the flavor profile.\n* Add a sprinkle of cinnamon or cocoa powder to the batter for an extra boost of flavor.\n* Substitute coconut milk or Greek yogurt for the almond milk for a creamier waffle.\n* Top with whipped cream, peanut butter, or Nutella for a decadent treat.\n\nEnjoy your delicious protein waffles!", token_ids=[334, 1360, 39340, 468, 45190, 26371, 57277, 27318, 826, 25, 220, 19, 12, 21, 289, 81635, 271, 334, 46847, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 16, 220, 16, 14, 17, 26446, 23255, 85270, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 10747, 63168, 20415, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 13128, 17138, 315, 701, 5873, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 15240, 88, 11, 1162, 258, 11, 477, 6136, 6108, 340, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 7120, 4589, 6901, 63168, 14403, 198, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 19151, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 50459, 34557, 5707, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 10747, 26828, 477, 5933, 10437, 804, 320, 13099, 340, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 42384, 28915, 17138, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 17, 42384, 12290, 198, 9, 220, 16, 14, 19, 42384, 33165, 8819, 198, 9, 350, 4880, 826, 320, 13099, 1680, 7878, 14098, 11, 31049, 11, 19595, 11, 477, 10184, 14432, 271, 334, 56391, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 5075, 20559, 701, 289, 45190, 11245, 4184, 311, 279, 14290, 596, 11470, 627, 17, 13, 763, 264, 3544, 19763, 11, 16343, 279, 85270, 11, 63168, 20415, 11, 323, 13128, 17138, 627, 18, 13, 763, 264, 8821, 19763, 11, 41759, 3871, 279, 63168, 14403, 11, 19151, 11, 50459, 34557, 5707, 11, 323, 26828, 477, 5933, 10437, 804, 320, 333, 1701, 4390, 19, 13, 2758, 279, 14739, 14293, 311, 279, 9235, 14293, 323, 23935, 3156, 264, 11113, 8919, 7739, 627, 20, 13, 2758, 279, 28915, 17138, 11, 12290, 11, 323, 33165, 881