want to include in your essay.\n\n**Minutes 31-90: Writing the Introduction and Body Paragraphs**\n\n* Start writing your introduction, using the outline as a guide.\n* Write the body paragraphs, using the notes and outline as a guide.\n* Aim to write around 1000 words in this section.\n\n**Minutes 91-120: Writing the Conclusion and Editing**\n\n* Write a conclusion that summarizes the main points and reiterates the thesis statement.\n* Review the essay for content, structure, and grammar.\n* Make any necessary edits to the introduction, body paragraphs, and conclusion.\n\n**Minutes 121-150: Final Review and Proofreading**\n\n* Review the essay one more time to ensure it meets the requirements.\n* Check for grammar, punctuation, and spelling errors.\n* Make any final edits or corrections.\n\nBy following this plan, you should be able to write a 1500-word essay in 3 hours. Remember to stay focused, take breaks if needed, and use your time wisely. Good luck!", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 3197, 311, 1520, 499, 3350, 264, 220, 3965, 15, 38428, 9071, 304, 220, 18, 4207, 1473, 334, 1489, 73767, 25, 57277, 9, 220, 966, 4520, 25, 18242, 323, 8830, 279, 8712, 320, 20, 4520, 8, 489, 31417, 27511, 287, 323, 79774, 320, 868, 4520, 8, 489, 8483, 320, 605, 4520, 340, 9, 220, 16, 6596, 25, 24838, 279, 17219, 323, 2547, 43743, 320, 1399, 4520, 340, 9, 220, 966, 4520, 25, 24838, 279, 17102, 323, 16039, 320, 966, 4520, 340, 9, 220, 966, 4520, 25, 13321, 3477, 323, 11311, 6285, 320, 966, 4520, 696, 334, 8468, 14656, 12, 8468, 9878, 25, 57277, 334, 28820, 220, 16, 12, 20, 25, 18242, 323, 46551, 279, 34011, 57277, 9, 4557, 279, 9071, 10137, 323, 3619, 1148, 374, 1694, 4691, 627, 9, 12040, 264, 2478, 4520, 311, 1781, 922, 279, 8712, 323, 1148, 499, 1390, 311, 2019, 627, 9, 622, 354, 1523, 904, 1401, 3585, 477, 6848, 430, 2586, 311, 4059, 382, 334, 28820, 220, 21, 12, 508, 25, 31417, 27511, 287, 323, 4470, 35981, 57277, 9, 5560, 279, 6848, 505, 279, 3766, 3094, 311, 1893, 459, 21782, 369, 