.\n\nThis chart provides a comparison of the total number of COVID-19 cases and deaths in different countries, as well as the number of new cases and deaths reported in the past 24 hours. The Case Fatality Rate (CFR) is also included to provide an indication of the severity of the pandemic in each country.', token_ids=[334, 79063, 12, 777, 47124, 323, 85812, 555, 14438, 320, 16593, 439, 315, 510, 5520, 2696, 2526, 57277, 91, 14438, 765, 10884, 47124, 765, 1561, 47124, 765, 10884, 85812, 765, 1561, 85812, 765, 11799, 26417, 2786, 20359, 320, 9847, 49, 8, 9432, 91, 12730, 765, 12730, 765, 12730, 765, 12730, 765, 12730, 765, 12730, 9432, 91, 3146, 23175, 4273, 334, 765, 220, 1644, 11, 931, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1135, 11, 931, 765, 220, 18216, 11, 931, 765, 220, 16, 11, 931, 765, 220, 16, 13, 4767, 4, 9432, 91, 3146, 34648, 334, 765, 220, 806, 11, 931, 11, 931, 765, 220, 966, 11, 931, 765, 220, 3965, 11, 931, 765, 220, 2636, 765, 220, 16, 13, 1927, 4, 9432, 91, 3146, 68299, 334, 765, 220, 23, 11, 931, 11, 931, 765, 220, 508, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1049, 11, 931, 765, 220, 2636, 765, 220, 17, 13, 1135, 4, 9432, 91, 3146, 45606, 334, 765, 220, 20, 11, 931, 11, 931, 765, 220, 605, 11, 931, 765, 220, 4364, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1049, 765, 220, 17, 13, 1272, 4, 9432, 91, 3146, 23175, 15422, 334, 765, 220, 19, 11, 931, 11, 931, 765, 220, 605, 11, 931, 765, 220, 4364, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1049, 765, 220, 18, 13, 410, 4, 9432, 91, 3146, 50100, 334, 765, 220, 18, 11, 931, 11, 931, 765, 220, 20, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1490, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1041, 765, 220, 17, 13, 3080, 4, 9432, 91, 3146, 51270, 334, 765, 220, 17, 11, 2636, 11, 931, 765, 220, 20, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1399, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1041, 765, 220, 17, 13, 1272, 4, 9432, 91, 3146, 71603, 334, 765, 220, 17, 11, 931, 11, 931, 765, 220, 18, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1135, 11, 931, 765, 220, 1135, 765, 220, 17, 13, 1135, 4, 9432, 91, 3146, 23078, 334, 765, 220, 16, 11, 2636, 11, 931, 765, 220, 16, 11, 931, 765, 220, 508, 11, 931, 765, 220, 605, 76