Output~2025-04-06 23:51:43.496340: [RequestOutput(request_id=367, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a procedure for creating a vegetable soup. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 10537, 369, 6968, 264, 36581, 19724, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**Procedure for Creating a Vegetable Soup**\n\n**Step 1: Gather Ingredients and Equipment**\n\n* 2 tablespoons of olive oil\n* 1 onion, chopped\n* 3 cloves of garlic, minced\n* 2 medium-sized carrots, peeled and chopped\n* 2 medium-sized potatoes, peeled and chopped\n* 1 large can of diced tomatoes (14.5 oz)\n* 4 cups of vegetable broth\n* 1 teaspoon of dried thyme\n* Salt and pepper, to taste\n* Fresh parsley, chopped (optional)\n* Large pot with a lid (at least 6-quart capacity)\n\n**Step 2: Prepare the Ingredients**\n\n* Heat the olive oil in the large pot over medium heat.\n* Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.\n* Add the minced garlic and sauté for an additional 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.\n* Add the chopped carrots and potatoes, and sauté for 5 minutes, until they start to soften.\n\n**Step 3: Add the Liquid and Seasonings**\n\n* Pour in the canned diced tomatoes, vegetable broth, and dried thyme. Stir well to combine.\n* Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20-25 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender.\n\n**Step 4: Season and Serve**\n\n* Season the soup with salt and pepper to taste.\n* Use an immersion blender to puree the soup to your desired consistency, or leave it chunky.\n* Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired.\n\n**Tips and Variations**\n\n* You can customize the soup to your taste by adding other vegetables, such as bell peppers, zucchini, or spinach.\n* For a creamier soup, add 1/4 cup of heavy cream or half-and-half towards the end of the simmering time.\n* To make the soup more substantial, add cooked pasta, rice, or beans.\n\nEnjoy your delicious and comforting vegetable soup!', token_ids=[334, 34255, 369, 32406, 264, 95392, 61434, 57277, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 52275, 323, 20849, 57277, 9, 220, 17, 56588, 315, 33213, 5707, 198, 9, 220, 16, 38427, 11, 38525, 198, 9, 220, 18, 85388, 315, 31735, 11, 94927, 198, 9, 220, 17, 11298, 28935, 62517, 11, 83612, 323, 38525, 198, 9, 220, 17, 11298, 28935, 35267, 11, 83612, 323, 38525, 198, 9, 220, 16, 3544, 649, 315, 89964, 41613, 320, 975, 13, 20, 25616, 340, 9, 220, 19, 26446, 315, 36581, 45993, 198, 9, 220, 16, 42384, 315, 32720, 270, 31218, 198, 9, 28138, 323, 25349, 11, 311, 12945, 198, 9, 30260, 88621, 11, 38525, 320, 13099, 340, 9, 20902, 3419, 449, 264, 27431, 320, 266, 3325, 220, 21, 74801, 472, 8824, 696, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 32266, 279, 52275, 57277, 9, 27162, 279, 33213, 5707, 304, 279, 3544, 3419, 927, 11298, 8798, 627, 9, 2758, 279, 38525, 38427, 323, 829, 332, 978, 3156, 85364, 11, 922, 220, 20, 4520, 627, 9, 2758, 279, 94927, 31735, 323, 829, 332, 978, 369, 459, 5217, 220, 16, 12, 17, 4520, 11, 3156, 8508, 35534, 627, 9, 2758, 279, 38525, 62517, 323, 35267, 11, 323, 829, 332, 978, 369, 220, 20, 4520, 11, 3156, 814, 1212, 311, 81045, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 2758, 279, 42358, 323, 14598, 826, 57277, 9, 27058, 304, 279, 64114, 89964, 41613, 11, 36581, 45993, 11, 323, 32720, 270, 31218, 13, 65292, 1664, 311, 16343, 627, 9, 40224, 279, 21655, 311, 264, 44790, 11, 1243, 8108, 279, 8798, 311, 3428, 323, 62915, 369, 220, 508, 12, 914, 4520, 11, 477, 3156, 279, 24822, 5