.\n4. **Arin Vex**: A mysterious, enigmatic figure with ties to the ancient mysticism of Nova Haven. Arin is a master of the planet\'s unique energy, known as the "Echoes," which hold the key to the planet\'s survival.\n\nAs the story unfolds, Aria, Kael, Sophia, and Arin find themselves drawn into a web of intrigue and deception, as they navigate the complex politics of the UGC and the resistance. With the fate of Nova Haven hanging in the balance, they must work together to uncover the truth about the planet\'s past, the UGC\'s true intentions, and the secrets of the Echoes.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2077, 430, 45695, 279, 1715, 1473, 334, 3936, 68063, 330, 76094, 288, 315, 469, 4253, 488, 1875, 334, 42562, 1082, 68063, 763, 279, 1060, 220, 13460, 23, 11, 22706, 706, 15235, 1534, 1023, 33975, 323, 14454, 279, 3723, 76317, 36892, 320, 62002, 8, 311, 10519, 9096, 323, 2015, 6957, 279, 34261, 13, 578, 3446, 5097, 2035, 389, 279, 11841, 315, 35741, 42714, 11, 264, 53414, 2322, 55422, 389, 279, 6964, 315, 279, 34261, 11, 1405, 11084, 5557, 323, 14154, 11679, 42914, 1080, 29675, 382, 334, 6334, 45616, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 32, 4298, 40486, 96618, 362, 220, 914, 4771, 6418, 26611, 55222, 323, 4562, 315, 459, 26326, 13957, 1912, 11039, 2403, 279, 549, 23710, 596, 78612, 17942, 13, 362, 4298, 374, 5211, 1285, 11, 79045, 9678, 11, 323, 57775, 555, 264, 54286, 1567, 304, 1077, 3347, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 42, 6015, 622, 52936, 96618, 362, 220, 966, 4771, 6418, 4846, 549, 23710, 27202, 6656, 16888, 47228, 11, 889, 706, 5675, 813, 19459, 315, 813, 3347, 323, 374, 15389, 369, 813, 837, 9764, 13, 735, 6015, 374, 55883, 11, 79323, 11, 323, 50326, 25363, 12896, 7512, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 9023, 13, 71471, 63855, 96618, 362, 20333, 28568, 323, 7808, 315, 279, 549, 23710, 596, 3495, 12764, 389, 35741, 42714, 13, 71471, 374, 8369, 11, 25530, 11, 323, 16625, 555, 264, 12876, 311, 15405, 279, 24511, 315, 279, 15861, 13, 3005, 9221, 1218, 40040, 304, 279, 12324, 1990, 279, 13957, 323, 27