Output~2025-04-06 23:52:16.827330: [RequestOutput(request_id=390, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a paragraph that describes a time when you achieved a difficult goal. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 14646, 430, 16964, 264, 892, 994, 499, 17427, 264, 5107, 5915, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="One of the most challenging goals I've ever achieved was completing a marathon in under four hours. It was a daunting task, as I had never run a marathon before and was only a casual runner at the time. I had to dedicate months of intense training, waking up at 5:00 AM every day to go for a 10-mile run before work. It was tough, both physically and mentally, but I was determined to push through the pain and reach my goal. On the day of the marathon, I felt nervous but focused as I lined up at the starting line. The first few miles were grueling, but as I hit my stride, I began to feel more confident and energized. With every step, I reminded myself of all the hard work I had put in and the sacrifices I had made. When I crossed the finish line in 3 hours and 59 minutes, I felt an overwhelming sense of pride and accomplishment. It was an incredible feeling, knowing that I had pushed myself to the limit and achieved something I never thought possible.", token_ids=[4054, 315, 279, 1455, 17436, 9021, 358, 3077, 3596, 17427, 574, 27666, 264, 45796, 304, 1234, 3116, 4207, 13, 1102, 574, 264, 57697, 3465, 11, 439, 358, 1047, 2646, 1629, 2