Output~2025-04-06 23:52:57.262047: [RequestOutput(request_id=407, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: What can I use to store books so they don\'t take up too much space? ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 3639, 649, 358, 1005, 311, 3637, 6603, 779, 814, 1541, 956, 1935, 709, 2288, 1790, 3634, 30, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="There are several options you can consider to store books and keep them organized while minimizing the space they occupy. Here are a few ideas:\n\n1. **Bookshelves**: Install bookshelves in your home or office to keep your books organized and easily accessible. You can choose from various types of bookshelves, such as wall-mounted, freestanding, or corner shelves.\n2. **Bookcases**: Bookcases are similar to bookshelves but often have more decorative elements, such as carvings or ornate details. They can add a touch of elegance to any room.\n3. **Stackable book boxes**: If you have limited floor space, consider using stackable book boxes or crates. These can be made of wood, plastic, or metal and can be easily stacked to store multiple books.\n4. **Under-bed storage**: If you have a bed with space underneath it, consider using under-bed storage bins or drawers to store books. This is a great way to utilize dead space and keep your books out of the way.\n5. **Book cubbies**: Book cubbies are small, individual compartments that can be attached to a wall or placed on a shelf. They're perfect for storing small books, magazines, or journals.\n6. **Book baskets**: Book baskets are a great way to store books in a decorative and cozy way. You can place them on a shelf or use them as a freestanding storage unit.\n7. **Ladder book storage**: A ladder book storage unit is a space-saving solution that allows you to store books on multiple levels. It's perfect for small rooms or apartments.\n8. **Over-the-door storage**: If you have limited wall space, consider using over-the-door storage racks or hooks to hang books, bags, or other items.\n\nRemember to choose a storage solution that fits your personal style, book collection, and available space. Happy reading!", token_ids=[3947, 527, 3892, 2671, 499, 649, 2980, 311, 3637, 6603, 323, 2567, 1124, 17057, 1418, 77391, 279, 3634, 814, 48678, 13, 5810, 527, 264, 2478, 6848, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 7280, 939, 4372, 96618, 19796, 2363, 939, 4372, 304, 701, 2162, 477, 5274, 311, 2567, 701, 6603, 17057, 323, 6847, 15987, 13, 1472, 649, 5268, 505, 5370, 4595, 315, 2363, 939, 4372, 11, 1778, 439, 7147, 78830, 11, 3541, 478, 26673, 11, 477, 9309, 36310, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 7280, 24857, 96618, 6017, 24857, 527, 4528, 311, 2363, 939, 4372, 719, 3629, 617, 810, 46536, 5540, 11, 1778, 439, 1841, 85, 826, 477, 40545, 349, 3649, 13, 2435, 649, 923, 264, 5916, 315, 64543, 311, 904, 3130, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 4434, 481, 2363, 15039, 96618, 1442, 499, 617, 7347, 6558, 3634, 11, 2980, 1701, 5729, 481, 2363, 15039, 477, 82820, 13, 4314, 649, 387, 1903, 315, 7732, 11, 12466, 11, 477, 9501, 323, 649, 387, 6847, 42415, 311, 3637, 5361, 6603, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 16648, 49607, 5942, 96618, 1442, 499, 617, 264, 4950, 449, 3634, 30456, 433, 11, 2980, 1701, 1234, 49607, 5942, 29618, 477, 62707, 311, 3637, 6603, 13, 1115, 374, 264, 2294, 1648, 311, 29166, 5710, 3634, 323, 2567, 701, 6603, 704, 315, 279, 1648, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 7280, 19250, 57773, 96618, 6017, 19250, 57773, 527, 2678, 11, 3927, 87352, 430, 649, 387, 12673, 311, 264, 7147, 477, 9277, 389, 264, 28745, 13, 2435, 2351, 4832