r each location.\n\nThis visualization allows us to quickly see that customers in the USA have the highest satisfaction rate, while customers in France have the lowest satisfaction rate. The UK falls in the middle. This visualization can help identify trends and patterns in customer satisfaction across different locations, which can inform business decisions to improve customer experience.\n\nNote: The satisfaction ratings are represented as a simple text label (Good, Neutral, Bad) for simplicity, but in a real-world scenario, you may want to use numerical values (e.g., 1-5) or a more nuanced rating system to allow for more detailed analysis.", token_ids=[1271, 1893, 264, 42148, 430, 46480, 279, 5133, 1990, 6130, 24617, 323, 3813, 11, 358, 1053, 4284, 6968, 264, 3703, 9676, 449, 3813, 389, 279, 865, 36421, 323, 24617, 389, 279, 379, 36421, 382, 8586, 596, 264, 3284, 42148, 1473, 334, 3511, 21964, 25, 12557, 94957, 555, 10067, 57277, 91, 10067, 765, 94957, 9432, 91, 12730, 765, 12730, 9432, 91, 7427, 765, 220, 19, 14, 20, 320, 15571, 8, 9432, 91, 6560, 765, 220, 18, 14, 20, 320, 88007, 8, 9432, 91, 9822, 765, 220, 16, 14, 20, 320, 17519, 8, 36821, 644, 420, 42148, 11, 279, 865, 36421, 11105, 279, 2204, 10687, 320, 25342, 11, 6560, 11, 323, 9822, 705, 323, 279, 379, 36421, 11105, 279, 6130, 24617, 18594, 320, 15571, 11, 59794, 11, 323, 11717, 570, 578, 2673, 315, 1855, 3703, 34310, 311, 279, 24617, 10959, 369, 1855, 3813, 382, 2028, 42148, 6276, 603, 311, 6288, 1518, 430, 6444, 304, 279, 7427, 617, 279, 8592, 24617, 4478, 11, 1418, 6444, 304, 9822, 617, 279, 15821, 24617, 4478, 13, 578, 6560, 17503, 304, 279, 6278, 13, 1115, 42148, 649, 1520, 10765, 18845, 323, 12912, 304, 6130, 24617, 4028, 2204, 10687, 11, 902, 649, 6179, 2626, 11429, 311, 7417, 6130, 3217, 382, 9290, 25, 578, 24617, 18594, 527, 15609, 439, 264, 4382, 1495, 2440, 320, 15571, 11, 59794, 11, 11717, 8, 369, 40075, 11, 719, 304, 264, 1972, 31184, 15398, 11, 499, 1253, 1390, 311, 1005, 35876, 2819, 320, 