Output~2025-04-06 23:58:09.326067: [RequestOutput(request_id=528, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Imagine you are about to go on a camping trip, what items would you bring? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 38891, 499, 527, 922, 311, 733, 389, 264, 33873, 8577, 11, 1148, 3673, 1053, 499, 4546, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="What an exciting adventure! As I'm getting ready for my camping trip, I'd make sure to pack the following essential items:\n\n**Clothing:**\n\n* Hiking boots or sturdy shoes\n* Comfortable camping clothes (t-shirts, pants, socks)\n* Insulating layers (fleece, jacket, hat, gloves)\n* Waterproof jacket and pants\n* Undergarments and a change of clothes in case of unexpected wetness\n* Sleepwear (pajamas, warm socks)\n\n**Shelter and Sleeping Gear:**\n\n* Tent\n* Sleeping bag and pad\n* Ground tarp or picnic blanket\n* Camping stakes and ropes\n* Sleeping bag liner (optional)\n\n**Cooking and Eating:**\n\n* Portable camping stove or camping grill\n* Cooking pot and utensils (spatula, fork, knife, etc.)\n* Plates, bowls, cups, and silverware\n* Water bottles or hydration pack\n* Food storage containers\n* Water purification tablets or filter (if needed)\n* Camping stove fuel or charcoal\n* Cooking oil and spices\n* Flashlight or headlamp\n* Extra batteries\n\n**Personal Hygiene:**\n\n* Toothbrush and toothpaste\n* Biodegradable soap and toilet paper\n* Wet wipes\n* Hand sanitizer\n* Biodegradable dish soap\n* Feminine hygiene products (if applicable)\n\n**First Aid and Safety:**\n\n* First aid kit with bandages, antiseptic wipes, pain relievers, etc.\n* Sunscreen and insect repellent\n* Fire starter (matches, lighter, or firestarters)\n* Flashlight or headlamp\n* Whistle or other signaling device\n* Map and compass or GPS device\n* Emergency shelter and warmth (space blanket, emergency bivvy sack)\n\n**Miscellaneous:**\n\n* Trash bags and a small shovel for waste disposal\n* Entertainment (books, games, cards, etc.)\n* Camera and charger\n* Phone and portable charger\n* Camp chair or camping stool\n* Bear spray or bear canister (if necessary)\n\nRemember to check the weather forecast and adjust your packing list accordingly. It's also a good idea to check with the campsite for any specific rules or regulations. With these items, I'll be well-prepared for a comfortable and enjoyable camping trip!", token_ids=[3923, 459, 13548, 18427, 0, 1666, 358, 2846, 3794, 5644, 369, 856, 33873, 8577, 11, 358, 4265, 1304, 2771, 311, 3854, 279, 2768, 7718, 3673, 1473, 334, 52336, 1626, 25, 57277, 9, 473, 19787, 26302, 477, 45652, 15653, 198, 9, 44842, 481, 33873, 15447, 320, 83, 49760, 11, 25567, 11, 40086, 340, 9, 9925, 15853, 13931, 320, 69, 8669, 346, 11, 27300, 11, 9072, 11, 36516, 340, 9, 79989, 27300, 323, 25567, 198, 9, 9636, 12440, 1392, 323, 264, 2349, 315, 15447, 304, 1162, 315, 16907, 14739, 2136, 198, 9, 24708, 23581, 320, 79, 1662, 29189, 11, 8369, 40086, 696, 334, 2059, 18354, 323, 75247, 28603, 25, 57277, 9, 67680, 198, 9, 75247, 9145, 323, 11262, 198, 9, 26486, 259, 8035, 477, 55562, 39139, 198, 9, 73141, 45525, 323, 65046, 198, 9, 75247, 9145, 54088, 320, 13099, 696, 334, 59482, 287, 323, 60638, 25, 57277, 9, 42585, 33873, 45115, 477, 33873, 40158, 198, 9, 57410, 3419, 323, 82036, 8839, 320, 2203, 266, 5724, 11, 23243, 11, 22145, 11, 5099, 29275, 9, 80393, 11, 61080, 11, 26446, 11, 323, 15310, 1698, 198, 9, 10164, 27474, 477, 88000, 3854, 198, 9, 12369, 5942, 24794, 198, 9, 10164, 