hes.\n8. **Audio or Video Issues**: The computer's audio or video settings are not functioning correctly, causing difficulties with multimedia playback or recording.\n9. **Display or Graphics Problems**: The computer's display is not functioning correctly, causing issues with screen resolution, brightness, or color accuracy.\n10. **Firmware or BIOS Issues**: The computer's firmware or BIOS is outdated or corrupted, causing problems with booting up the computer or configuring settings.\n\nThese are just a few examples of the many problems that a computer user might experience.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 220, 605, 3284, 5435, 430, 264, 6500, 1217, 2643, 3217, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 59389, 17863, 21304, 96618, 578, 6500, 5097, 264, 1317, 892, 311, 1212, 709, 11, 7195, 8522, 11, 477, 4686, 9256, 11, 3339, 433, 5107, 311, 990, 30820, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 36779, 11278, 37543, 96618, 578, 1217, 374, 12153, 311, 4667, 311, 279, 7757, 477, 11704, 21420, 834, 51086, 11, 3339, 433, 5107, 311, 2680, 2930, 5070, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 19805, 8444, 26286, 96618, 362, 3230, 3241, 3851, 477, 2068, 37237, 477, 94477, 14134, 11, 14718, 33086, 323, 5675, 26206, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 1061, 25733, 477, 90894, 96618, 44921, 3626, 477, 828, 527, 5675, 11, 50500, 11, 477, 11309, 11, 13239, 304, 279, 1205, 311, 11993, 477, 53875, 279, 5675, 2038, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 46760, 477, 17613, 37543, 96618, 578, 23185, 477, 21438, 374, 539, 31301, 10489, 11, 14718, 27129, 449, 18991, 477, 36201, 9477, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 4981, 477, 8955, 45635, 96618, 578, 1217, 374, 12153, 311, 1515, 304, 311, 872, 2759, 477, 10894, 82, 872, 3636, 11, 14718, 61109, 323, 7781, 627, 22, 13, 3146, 53, 17402, 477, 8560, 1698, 763, 13421, 96618, 578, 6500, 374, 29374, 449, 264, 17188, 477, 40831, 11, 902, 649, 30485, 828, 4868, 323, 5353, 1887, 37237, 627, 23, 13, 3146, 15097, 477, 8519, 37543, 96618, 578, 6500, 596, 7855, 477, 2835, 5110, 527, 539, 31301, 12722, 11, 14718, 27129, 449, 57613, 33059, 477, 14975, 627, 24, 