icon of a leaf or a sprout is placed in the top-right corner of the billboard, symbolizing growth and wellness.\n* A subtle pattern of leaves or vines is incorporated into the background of the billboard, adding texture and visual interest.\n* The font used for the headline and body text is clean, modern, and easy to read, with a friendly and approachable tone.\n\n**Overall:**\n\nThis design aims to appeal to people who prefer healthy eating habits by showcasing a vibrant and appetizing visual representation of fresh, whole foods. The headline and body text emphasize the benefits of healthy eating, while the call-to-action encourages viewers to take the first step towards a healthier lifestyle. The overall design is visually appealing, easy to read, and communicates a clear message that resonates with the target audience.', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 4754, 2955, 369, 264, 86306, 430, 35730, 311, 1274, 889, 10932, 9498, 12459, 26870, 1473, 334, 9789, 82, 25, 57277, 791, 86306, 4519, 264, 34076, 323, 34966, 4092, 449, 264, 8369, 11, 5933, 16630, 13, 763, 279, 4219, 11, 264, 6366, 11, 7878, 14098, 33566, 374, 28902, 304, 264, 28029, 5497, 11, 449, 264, 8205, 315, 26390, 1778, 439, 76203, 11, 6437, 36989, 11, 66008, 11, 323, 78182, 13, 578, 26390, 527, 28902, 304, 264, 1648, 430, 11705, 264, 5647, 315, 7351, 323, 4907, 11, 439, 422, 814, 2351, 77850, 449, 99316, 323, 75716, 382, 334, 12626, 1074, 25, 57277, 93466, 414, 819, 4718, 14285, 11, 452, 414, 819, 4718, 30242, 1875, 334, 5561, 2991, 25, 57277, 78299, 266, 1664, 11, 2733, 8056, 0, 34039, 279, 2410, 315, 4459, 11, 6136, 6108, 15657, 323, 1212, 701, 11879, 311, 23669, 2890, 13, 5659, 7878, 26390, 323, 60399, 311, 4459, 41936, 323, 16025, 28896, 11, 1057, 30687, 3637, 374, 701, 832, 42311, 8221, 369, 682, 701, 9498, 12459, 3966, 13, 19545, 603, 3432, 323, 12945, 279, 6811, 369, 6261, 17642, 334, 7368, 4791, 12, 2573, 25, 57277, 1, 1991, 3940, 389, 701, 9498, 12459, 11879, 3432, 0, 19545, 1057, 3637, 323, 5371, 264, 