Output~2025-04-07 00:01:23.657139: [RequestOutput(request_id=587, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Design an avatar for a fictional character. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 7127, 459, 21359, 369, 264, 44682, 3752, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a response that completes the request:\n\n**Name:** Lyra Flynn\n\n**Appearance:** Lyra is a 25-year-old half-elf rogue with a lean and agile build. She has piercing emerald green eyes and shoulder-length, curly silver hair that falls like a waterfall down her back. Her skin has a warm, golden undertone, a testament to her mixed heritage. She stands at 5\'8" with a lithe, athletic physique, honed from years of climbing and acrobatics.\n\n**Attire:** Lyra wears a sleek black leather armor set, adorned with intricate, swirling patterns that seem to shift and shimmer in the light. The armor is lightweight and flexible, allowing her to move with ease and precision. Around her neck, she wears a delicate silver pendant in the shape of a crescent moon, a symbol of her connection to the mystical forces she wields.\n\n**Personality:** Lyra is a free spirit, always chasing the next thrill and never staying in one place for too long. She has a mischievous grin and a quick wit, often using her charm and cunning to talk her way out of sticky situations. Despite her carefree nature, Lyra has a strong sense of justice and will fiercely defend those she cares about. She is fiercely independent and non-conformist, often challenging authority and pushing boundaries to see what\'s possible.\n\n**Abilities:** Lyra is an expert in stealth, acrobatics, and illusions. She can create elaborate deceptions, making it difficult for her enemies to discern reality from fantasy. She is also skilled in hand-to-hand combat, using her agility and quick reflexes to dodge and disarm her opponents.\n\n**Background:** Lyra was born to a human father and an elven mother, who was a member of a secretive organization of mystics. As a child, Lyra was trained in the mystical arts, learning to harness her innate magical abilities. She left her family\'s organization to strike out on her own, seeking adventure and excitement in the wider world. Now, she travels the land, taking on odd jobs and righting wrongs, always staying one step ahead of danger and intrigue.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2077, 430, 45695, 279, 1715, 1473, 334, 678, 68063, 16333, 969, 40486, 271, 334, 30327, 68063, 16333, 969, 374, 264, 220, 914, 4771, 6418, 4376, 12, 491, 54991, 449, 264, 16025, 323, 62565, 1977, 13, 3005, 706, 60220, 991, 25380, 6307, 6548, 323, 17308, 30425, 11, 69203, 15310, 7013, 430, 17503, 1093, 264, 70151, 1523, 1077, 1203, 13, 6385, 6930, 706, 264, 8369, 11, 21411, 19165, 606, 11, 264, 61300, 311, 1077, 9709, 28948, 13, 3005, 13656, 520, 220, 20, 6, 23, 1, 449, 264, 13318, 383, 11, 29703, 64441, 11, 5954, 291, 505, 1667, 315, 30608, 323, 1645, 23576, 29470, 382, 334, 10673, 556, 68063, 16333, 969, 38400, 264, 48494, 3776, 18012, 20634, 743, 11, 84273, 449, 57216, 11, 93378, 12912, 430, 2873, 311, 6541, 323, 76461, 304, 279, 3177, 13, 578, 20634, 374, 30244, 323, 19303, 11, 10923, 1077, 311, 3351, 449, 14553, 323, 16437, 13, 33916, 1077, 13272, 11, 1364, 38400, 264, 36301, 15310, 42844, 304, 279, 6211, 315, 264, 46858, 1189, 18266, 11, 264, 7891, 315, 1077, 3717, 311, 279, 69532, 8603, 1364, 289, 7052, 382, 334, 10909, 2786, 68063, 16333, 969, 374, 264, 1949, 9090, 11, 2744, 43931, 279, 1828, 5490