mily) might make the movie more relatable and accessible to a younger audience.\n\nOverall, I think the movie would receive a decent rating on IMDB, likely in the 6.5-7.0 range, as it checks off many of the boxes for a classic horror movie. The rating could be influenced by factors such as the quality of the acting, the effectiveness of the scares, and the originality of the plot.", token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 22169, 5818, 81763, 11, 358, 1053, 7168, 430, 279, 5818, 1053, 5371, 264, 10959, 315, 2212, 220, 21, 13, 20, 12, 22, 13, 15, 389, 6654, 3590, 13, 5810, 596, 856, 33811, 1473, 9, 578, 6376, 315, 264, 83410, 7474, 3190, 374, 264, 11670, 22169, 85248, 11, 902, 374, 3629, 5938, 449, 264, 5647, 315, 31398, 323, 34104, 13, 1115, 649, 1893, 264, 5647, 315, 24408, 323, 8850, 304, 279, 10877, 627, 9, 578, 2144, 430, 264, 1912, 315, 7926, 4236, 527, 279, 1925, 5885, 11621, 311, 279, 5647, 315, 34104, 11, 439, 814, 527, 4461, 311, 387, 79966, 323, 653, 61212, 369, 279, 70618, 430, 2597, 1124, 627, 9, 578, 4623, 315, 1694, 8818, 1534, 520, 264, 83410, 7474, 3190, 24897, 430, 279, 5885, 690, 387, 13176, 264, 50058, 477, 92697, 6023, 11, 902, 649, 387, 264, 4279, 7057, 304, 22169, 9698, 627, 9, 4452, 11, 279, 2144, 430, 433, 596, 264, 1912, 315, 7926, 4236, 323, 539, 264, 810, 10534, 477, 10235, 1912, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 264, 2128, 315, 26453, 477, 264, 3070, 8, 2643, 1304, 279, 5818, 810, 1375, 15436, 323, 15987, 311, 264, 14992, 10877, 382, 28589, 11, 358, 1781, 279, 5818, 1053, 5371, 264, 15326, 10959, 389, 6654, 3590, 11, 4461, 304, 279, 220, 21, 13, 20, 12, 22, 13, 15, 2134, 11, 439, 433, 12621, 1022, 1690, 315, 279, 15039, 369, 264, 11670, 22169, 5818, 13, 578, 10959, 1436, 387, 28160, 555, 9547, 1778, 439, 279, 4367, 315, 279, 15718, 11, 279, 27375, 315, 279, 97471, 11, 323, 279, 4113, 488, 315, 279, 7234, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None,