Output~2025-04-07 00:03:41.611439: [RequestOutput(request_id=628, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Given an example of a smart home appliance, explain its features. ### Input: Google Home ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 16644, 459, 3187, 315, 264, 7941, 2162, 56454, 11, 10552, 1202, 4519, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 5195, 5492, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='The Google Home is a smart speaker and home automation hub developed by Google. It is a voice-controlled device that can perform a variety of tasks, making it a convenient and innovative addition to any smart home. Here are some of its key features:\n\n1. **Voice Assistant**: Google Home is powered by Google Assistant, a highly advanced AI-powered voice assistant that can understand natural language and respond accordingly. You can ask it to perform tasks, answer questions, and even control other smart devices in your home.\n\n2. **Smart Home Control**: Google Home can control a wide range of smart devices, including lights, thermostats, security cameras, and more. You can use voice commands to turn devices on and off, adjust settings, and monitor their status.\n\n3. **Music and Media**: Google Home can play music from various streaming services like Google Play Music, Spotify, and more. You can also use it to play podcasts, audiobooks, and radio stations.\n\n4. **Information and News**: Google Home can provide information on a wide range of topics, including news, weather, sports, and more. You can ask it to read out news articles, provide weather updates, or even set reminders and alarms.\n\n5. **Multi-Room Audio**: Google Home supports multi-room audio, allowing you to play the same music in multiple rooms or different music in different rooms.\n\n6. **Integration with Other Devices**: Google Home integrates seamlessly with other Google devices, such as Chromecast and Android devices, making it easy to control your smart home and access your favorite content.\n\n7. **Hands-Free Calling and Messaging**: Google Home allows you to make hands-free calls and send messages to other Google Home devices or mobile phones.\n\n8. **Security and Privacy**: Google Home has robust security features, including encryption and secure storage of user data, to ensure your personal information remains private.\n\nOverall, the Google Home is a versatile and convenient smart speaker that can make your life easier and more enjoyable. Its advanced features and seamless integration with other devices make it an excellent addition to any smart home.', token_ids=[791, 5195, 5492, 374, 264, 7941, 19114, 323, 2162, 33762, 19240, 8040, 555, 5195, 13, 1102, 374, 264, 7899, 41370, 3756, 430, 649, 2804, 264, 8205, 315, 9256, 11, 3339, 433, 264, 17125, 323, 18699, 5369, 311, 904, 7941, 2162, 13, 5810, 527, 1063, 315, 1202, 1401, 4519, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 52267, 22103, 96618, 5195, 5492, 374, 23134, 555, 5195, 22103, 11, 264, 7701, 11084, 15592, 41503, 7899, 18328, 430, 649, 3619, 5933, 4221, 323, 6013, 28178, 13, 1472, 649, 2610, 433, 311, 2804, 9256, 11, 4320, 4860, 11, 323, 1524, 2585, 1023, 7941, 7766, 304, 701, 2162, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 34917, 5492, 7935, 96618, 5195, 5492, 649, 2585, 264, 7029, 2134, 315, 7941, 7766, 11, 2737, 13001, 11, 9139, 3646, 1900, 11, 4868, 18632, 11, 323, 810, 13, 1472, 649, 1005, 7899, 11545, 311, 2543, 7766, 389, 323, 1022, 11, 7652, 5110, 11, 323, 8891