Output~2025-04-07 00:09:53.801047: [RequestOutput(request_id=774, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Prepare a speech to give an inspirational talk to primary school children. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 32266, 264, 8982, 311, 3041, 459, 57314, 3137, 311, 6156, 2978, 2911, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**Title:** "Believe in Yourself: You Can Achieve Anything!"\n\n**Hello, young friends!**\n\nI am so excited to be speaking with all of you today. I want to talk to you about something very important: believing in yourself. You are all amazing individuals with unique talents, skills, and abilities. And I want to remind you that you have the power to achieve anything you set your minds to.\n\n**You are capable of great things!**\n\nAs a child, you are constantly learning and growing. You are learning new things every day, and that\'s something to be proud of. But sometimes, we might feel like we\'re not good enough or that we can\'t do something. That\'s okay! It\'s normal to feel that way. But I want to tell you that you are capable of overcoming any obstacle.\n\n**Your dreams are within reach!**\n\nImagine you\'re playing your favorite game or doing your favorite activity. You\'re having so much fun, and you feel like you\'re on top of the world. That\'s what it\'s like when you believe in yourself. When you believe in your abilities, you can achieve anything.\n\n**Don\'t be afraid to try!**\n\nSometimes, we might be afraid to try something new because we\'re worried we\'ll fail. But failure is not the end of the world. In fact, it\'s often a stepping stone to success. Thomas Edison, the inventor of the light bulb, failed over 1,000 times before he got it right. But he didn\'t give up. He kept trying, and look what he achieved!\n\n**You are strong and brave!**\n\nYou are all strong and brave in your own ways. You face challenges every day, and you overcome them. You might not even realize how amazing you are, but trust me, you are. You are capable of achieving great things, and I believe in you.\n\n**So, what can you do?**\n\nHere are a few things you can do to believe in yourself:\n\n* Take risks and try new things.\n* Don\'t be afraid to ask for help when you need it.\n* Celebrate your successes, no matter how small they may seem.\n* Surround yourself with positive people who believe in you.\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nRemember, you are capable of achieving anything you set your mind to. Believe in yourself, take risks, and never give up. You are strong, brave, and amazing, and I believe in you. Keep shining your light and making your dreams come true!\n\n**Thank you for listening', token_ids=[334, 3936, 68063, 330, 22404, 19704, 304, 60005, 25, 1472, 3053, 42224, 588, 42033, 17642, 334, 9906, 11, 3995, 4885, 0, 57277, 40, 1097, 779, 12304, 311, 387, 12365, 449, 682, 315, 499, 3432, 13, 358, 1390, 311, 3137, 311, 499, 922, 2555, 1633, 3062, 25, 35090, 304, 6261, 13, 1472, 527, 682, 8056, 7931, 449, 5016, 35032, 11, 7512, 11, 323, 18000, 13, 1628, 358, 1390, 311, 24928, 499, 430, 499, 617, 279, 2410, 311, 11322, 4205, 499, 743, 701, 20663, 311, 382, 334, 2675, 527, 13171, 315, 2294, 2574, 0, 57277, 2170, 264, 1716, 11, 499, 527, 15320, 6975, 323, 7982, 13, 1472, 527, 6975, 502, 2574, 1475, 1938, 11, 323, 430, 596, 2555, 311, 387, 12691, 315, 13, 2030, 7170, 11, 584, 2643, 2733, 1093, 584, 2351, 539, 1695, 3403, 477, 430, 584, 649, 956, 656, 2555, 13, 3011, 596, 17339, 0, 1102, 596, 4725, 311, 2733, 43