ch is the primary judicial organ of the UN\n\nThe UN has a number of specialized agencies, programs, and organizations that work on specific issues such as:\n\n1. The World Health Organization (WHO)\n2. The United Nations Children\'s Fund (UNICEF)\n3. The United Nations Development Programme (UNDP)\n4. The United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR)\n5. The World Food Programme (WFP)\n\nThe UN also has a number of peacekeeping and peacebuilding operations around the world, which aim to maintain peace and stability in conflict-affected areas.\n\nOverall, the United Nations plays a crucial role in promoting international cooperation and addressing global challenges, and is widely regarded as a vital institution in the pursuit of peace, security, and development.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 12399, 315, 279, 27685, 4652, 389, 330, 791, 3723, 19687, 52518, 791, 3723, 19687, 320, 1899, 8, 374, 459, 6625, 7471, 430, 574, 9749, 304, 220, 6393, 20, 449, 279, 9395, 315, 22923, 9096, 11, 4868, 11, 323, 23915, 4315, 1202, 4562, 5415, 13, 578, 6781, 374, 81296, 304, 1561, 4356, 4409, 323, 706, 220, 7285, 4562, 5415, 13, 578, 7471, 574, 18538, 304, 279, 40696, 315, 4435, 5111, 8105, 11, 449, 279, 16351, 315, 279, 3723, 19687, 49705, 555, 220, 3971, 5961, 389, 5651, 220, 1627, 11, 220, 6393, 20, 382, 791, 6781, 596, 1925, 9021, 527, 311, 1473, 16, 13, 87477, 6625, 9096, 323, 4868, 198, 17, 13, 8000, 11919, 4398, 4315, 17089, 198, 18, 13, 42224, 588, 6625, 23915, 389, 7100, 11, 3674, 11, 323, 38748, 4819, 198, 19, 13, 18042, 1295, 5201, 369, 3823, 3268, 323, 16188, 61077, 271, 791, 6781, 706, 3892, 1401, 36853, 11, 2737, 1473, 16, 13, 578, 3331, 12000, 11, 902, 374, 279, 1925, 21835, 1413, 323, 18740, 2942, 315, 279, 6781, 198, 17, 13, 578, 8398, 9251, 11, 902, 374, 8647, 369, 20958, 6625, 9096, 323, 4868, 198, 18, 13, 578, 23362, 323, 9983, 9251, 320, 7650, 3204, 7767, 705, 902, 14259, 7100, 323, 3674, 7640, 198, 19, 13, 578, 8769, 41979, 11, 902, 374, 279, 23541, 2942,