Output~2025-04-07 00:12:05.602999: [RequestOutput(request_id=829, prompt='<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{"Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a story that\'s corny and cheesy. ### Response:"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 5018, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 3446, 430, 596, 14095, 88, 323, 87847, 13, 17010, 6075, 3047, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here's a story that's as corny and cheesy as can be:\n\nIn the quaint town of Lovville, nestled in the heart of the Sunshine State, there lived a hero unlike any other. His name was Captain Cheeto, a dashing young man with a heart of gold and a smile that could light up the darkest of caves.\n\nCaptain Cheeto was on a mission to save the world from the evil clutches of the notorious Dr. Brie, a mad scientist with a penchant for creating the most heinous of cheeses. Dr. Brie had stolen the world's most precious treasure, the Golden Cheddar, and was using its power to turn the world's milk into a never-ending supply of processed cheese slices.\n\nCaptain Cheeto, with his trusty sidekick, a talking cat named Whiskers, set out to stop Dr. Brie and retrieve the Golden Cheddar. Along the way, they encountered a cast of colorful characters, including a wise-cracking parrot named Polly, a bumbling but lovable robot named Rusty, and a beautiful princess named Princess Feta, who was being held captive by Dr. Brie.\n\nAs they journeyed through the land, Captain Cheeto and his friends encountered many obstacles, including treacherous cheese caves, treacherous cheese rivers, and even a giant, talking wheel of cheddar. But with their bravery, wit, and a healthy dose of cheese-themed puns, they were able to overcome each challenge and finally reach Dr. Brie's lair.\n\nIn a thrilling showdown, Captain Cheeto and Dr. Brie engaged in an epic battle of wits, with Captain Cheeto emerging victorious and reclaiming the Golden Cheddar. With the world's milk once again safe from the evil clutches of processed cheese, Captain Cheeto and his friends were hailed as heroes and celebrated with a grand feast of the world's finest cheeses.\n\nAnd so, the people of Lovville lived happily ever after, with Captain Cheeto and his friends always ready to defend the world from the forces of processed cheese. The end.", token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 3446, 430, 596, 439, 14095, 88, 323, 87847, 439, 649, 387, 1473, 644, 279, 88608, 6424, 315, 35393, 8078, 11, 89777, 304, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 62394, 3314, 11, 1070, 12439, 264, 12084, 20426, 904, 1023, 13, 5414, 836, 574, 22022, 356, 3759, 78, 11, 264, 294, 19587, 3995, 893, 449, 264, 4851, 315, 6761, 323, 264, 15648, 430, 1436, 3177, 709, 279, 77069, 315, 66664, 382, 62158, 356, 3759, 78, 574, 389, 264, 9131, 311, 3665, 279, 1917, 505, 279, 14289, 1206, 88449, 315, 279, 44081, 2999, 13, 426, 7379, 11, 264, 13088, 28568, 449, 264, 99780, 369, 6968, 279, 1455, 568, 61798, 315, 98564, 13, 2999, 13, 426, 7379, 1047, 23130, 279, 1917, 596, 1455, 27498, 32726, 11, 279, 18288, 921, 78716, 11, 323, 574, 1701, 1202, 2410, 311, 2543, 279, 1917, 596, 14403, 1139, 264, 2646, 67897, 8312, 315, 15590, 17604, 35354, 382, 62158, 356, 3759, 78, 11, 449, 813, 7095, 88, 3185, 56893, 11, 264, 7556, 8415, 7086, 1254, 3267, 388, 11, 743, 704, 311, 3009, 2999, 13, 426, 7379, 323, 17622, 279, 18288, 921, 78716, 13, 32944, 279, 1648, 11, 814, 23926, 264, 6445, 315, 34966, 5885, 11, 2737, 264, 24219, 48689, 9162, 1370, 4744, 7086, 94517, 11, 264, 293, 42732, 719, 781, 24694, 12585, 7086, 34889, 88, 11, 323, 264, 6366, 40688, 7086, 30389, 435, 1955, 11, 889, 574, 1694, 