uest a refund, please provide your order number and the reason for the return. I'll guide you through the process and provide any necessary instructions.\n\n**Account Management**\n\nIf you'd like to update your account information or reset your password, please provide your email address associated with your account. I'll do my best to assist you with the necessary changes.\n\n**General Inquiry**\n\nIf you have any other questions or concerns, please feel free to ask! I'll do my best to provide a helpful response.\n\n**Follow-up Questions**\n\nIf I need more information to assist you, I'll ask follow-up questions to clarify your request. Please feel free to provide as much detail as possible.\n\n**Closing**\n\nThank you for reaching out to our customer service team. If I was unable to fully resolve your issue, please don't hesitate to reach out to us again. We're always here to help. Have a great day!\n\nThis script provides a basic structure for a customer service chatbot, with options for common customer inquiries and a general inquiry option for any other questions or concerns. The script is designed to be flexible and adaptable to different customer needs, with follow-up questions to clarify any unclear requests.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 6205, 15592, 6369, 6465, 5429, 369, 264, 6130, 2532, 15398, 1473, 334, 14262, 4961, 57277, 9906, 0, 9930, 499, 369, 19261, 704, 311, 1057, 6130, 2532, 2128, 13, 3092, 836, 374, 13149, 6465, 11, 323, 358, 3358, 387, 6380, 311, 7945, 499, 449, 904, 4860, 477, 10742, 499, 1253, 617, 13, 2650, 649, 358, 1520, 499, 3432, 1980, 334, 6334, 9937, 57277, 5618, 3373, 832, 315, 279, 2768, 2671, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 4531, 47170, 96618, 4343, 279, 2704, 315, 701, 3293, 2015, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 4921, 8245, 96618, 15281, 810, 922, 1057, 3956, 323, 3600, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 16851, 323, 8718, 44050, 96618, 8773, 264, 471, 477, 1715, 264, 21639, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 7516, 9744, 96618, 5666, 701, 2759, 2038, 477, 7738, 701, 3636, 627, 20, 13, 314