Output~2025-04-07 00:13:45.530642: [RequestOutput(request_id=868, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Provide examples of three common types of layout in websites. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 40665, 10507, 315, 2380, 4279, 4595, 315, 6932, 304, 13335, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here are three common types of layout in websites:\n\n1. **Grid Layout**: A grid layout is a popular and versatile layout style that divides the website into rows and columns, creating a grid-like structure. This layout is often used for news websites, blogs, and online magazines, as it allows for easy organization and navigation of content. For example, the website of The New York Times uses a grid layout to display its news articles and sections.\n\n2. **Responsive Layout**: A responsive layout is a design approach that adapts to the size and type of device used to access the website. This means that the layout changes its structure and design elements (such as font size, image size, and navigation menu) to ensure a smooth user experience across different devices, including desktops, tablets, and smartphones. For example, the website of Amazon uses a responsive layout to adjust its design and content to fit different screen sizes and devices.\n\n3. **Fixed Width Layout**: A fixed width layout is a design approach that sets a fixed width for the website's content area, regardless of the size of the device or screen. This layout is often used for websites that require a specific design or branding, such as corporate websites or e-commerce sites. For example, the website of Apple uses a fixed width layout to maintain its distinctive design and branding across different devices and screen sizes.\n\nThese are just a few examples of common website layouts, and there are many variations and combinations of these layouts used in modern web design.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 2380, 4279, 4595, 315, 6932, 304, 13335, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 3627, 14141, 96618, 362, 5950, 6932, 374, 264, 5526, 323, 33045, 6932, 1742, 430, 65928, 279, 3997, 1139, 7123, 323, 8310, 11, 6968, 264, 5950, 12970, 6070, 13, 1115, 6932, 374, 3629, 1511, 369, 3754, 13335, 11, 26743, 11, 323, 2930, 32947, 11, 439, 433, 6276, 369, 4228, 7471, 323, 10873, 315, 2262, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 279, 3997, 315, 578, 1561, 4356, 8691, 5829, 264, 5950, 6932, 311, 3113, 1202, 3754, 9908, 323, 14491, 382, 17, 13, 3146, 79895, 14141, 96618, 362, 27078, 6932, 374, 264, 2955, 5603, 430, 39732, 2641, 311, 279, 1404, 323, 955, 315, 3756, 1511, 311, 2680, 279, 3997, 13, 1115, 3445, 430, 279, 6932, 4442, 1202, 6070, 323, 2955, 5540, 320, 21470, 439, 3381, 1404, 11, 2217, 1404, 11, 323, 10873, 5130, 8, 311, 6106, 264, 11113, 1217, 3217, 4028, 2204, 7766, 11, 2737, 17963, 82, 11, 29679, 11, 323, 36122, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 279, 3997, 315, 8339, 5829, 264, 27078, 6932, 311, 7652, 1202, 2955, 323, 2262, 311, 5052, 2204, 4264, 12562, 323, 7766, 382, 18, 13, 3146, 13829, 25650, 14141, 96618, 362, 8521, 2430, 6932, 374, 264, 2955, 5603, 430, 7437, 264, 8521, 2430, 369, 279, 3997, 596, 2262, 3158, 11, 15851, 315, 279, 1404, 315, 279, 3756, 477, 4264, 13, 1115, 6932, 374, 3629, 1511, 369, 13335, 430, 1397, 264, 3230, 2955, 477, 44817, 11, 1778, 439, 13166, 13335, 477, 384, 42685, 6732, 13, 1789, 3187, 11, 279, 3997, 315, 8325, 5829, 264, 8521, 2430, 6932, 311, 10519, 1202, 35947, 2955, 323, 44817, 4028, 2204, 7766, 323, 4264, 12562, 382, 9673, 527, 1120, 264, 2478, 10507, 315, 4279, 3997, 50154,