Output~2025-04-07 00:15:31.145688: [RequestOutput(request_id=903, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a story of a child who is afraid of the dark ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 3446, 315, 264, 1716, 889, 374, 16984, 315, 279, 6453, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**The Little Boy Who Was Afraid of the Dark**\n\nTimmy was a bright and curious six-year-old boy who loved playing with his toys and exploring the world around him. However, despite his adventurous spirit, Timmy had one major fear: the dark. The moment the lights went out, he would start to tremble with anxiety and beg his parents to turn them back on.\n\nOne evening, as the sun began to set, Timmy\'s parents decided to have a family movie night. They set up a cozy blanket and pillows in the living room, popped some popcorn, and settled in to watch a favorite film. As the lights dimmed, Timmy\'s eyes grew wide with fear.\n\n"Mom, can we please turn the lights back on?" he begged, his voice shaking.\n\nHis parents, understanding his fear, tried to reassure him. "It\'s okay, Timmy, the dark is just the absence of light. There\'s nothing to be afraid of," his mom said, giving him a gentle hug.\n\nBut Timmy was inconsolable. He clung to his mom\'s leg, his eyes fixed on the dark corners of the room. His parents tried to distract him with the movie, but he was too scared to focus.\n\nJust then, his dad had an idea. "Hey, Timmy, why don\'t we make a special flashlight for you?" he asked, rummaging through a drawer for some supplies. He handed Timmy a small flashlight and a piece of paper.\n\nTogether, they decorated the flashlight with stickers and markers, making it look like a superhero\'s trusty sidekick. Timmy\'s eyes lit up as he held the flashlight, feeling a sense of bravery wash over him.\n\nWith his new flashlight by his side, Timmy was able to face the dark. He turned off the main lights and, with his parents\' guidance, explored the darkened room. He discovered that the shadows were just shadows, and the creaks and groans of the old house were just the house settling.\n\nAs the night went on, Timmy\'s fear began to fade away, replaced by a sense of excitement and adventure. He realized that the dark wasn\'t so scary after all, and that with a little bit of courage and a trusty flashlight, he could conquer even the darkest of nights.\n\nFrom that day on, Timmy was no longer afraid of the dark. He would proudly carry his flashlight with him, ready to face whatever darkness came his way. And his parents would smile, knowing', token_ids=[334, 791, 15013, 16576, 10699, 15148, 13203, 14152, 315, 279, 12538, 57277, 20830, 2465, 574, 264, 10107, 323, 22999, 4848, 4771, 6418, 8334, 889, 10456, 5737, 449, 813, 23939, 323, 24919, 279, 1917, 2212, 1461, 13, 4452, 11, 8994, 813, 68188, 9090, 11, 9538, 2465, 1047, 832, 3682, 8850, 25, 279, 6453, 13, 578, 4545, 279, 13001, 4024, 704, 11, 568, 1053, 1212, 311, 18659, 901, 449, 18547, 323, 2197, 813, 6699, 311, 2543, 1124, 1203, 389, 382, 4054, 11714, 11, 439, 279, 7160, 6137, 311, 743, 11, 9538, 2465, 596, 6699, 6773, 311, 617, 264, 3070, 5818, 3814, 13, 2435, 743, 709, 264, 43535, 39139, 323, 67026, 304, 279, 5496, 3130, 11, 43333, 1063, 70805, 11, 323, 23183, 304, 311, 3821, 264, 7075, 4632, 13, 1666, 279, 13001, 5213, 2106, 11, 9538, 2465, 596, 6548, 14264, 7029, 449, 8850, 382, 1, 59883, 11, 649, 584, 4587, 2543, 279, 13001, 1203, 389, 7673, 568, 80392, 11, 813, 7899, 38839, 382, 163