y 2025.\n\t* Implement policies to support the development of renewable energy projects, such as tax credits and net metering laws.\n\n**Medium-term goals (2025-2030):**\n\n1. **Electrify transportation:**\n\t* Set a target of 50% of new vehicle sales to be electric or hybrid by 2030.\n\t* Invest in charging infrastructure to support the growth of electric vehicles.\n2. **Build energy-efficient buildings:**\n\t* Implement building codes and standards that prioritize energy efficiency in new construction and retrofitting of existing buildings.\n\t* Offer incentives for building owners to invest in energy-efficient upgrades.\n3. **Carbon pricing:**\n\t* Implement a carbon pricing mechanism to provide a financial incentive for reducing fossil fuel consumption.\n\t* Use revenue generated from carbon pricing to fund clean energy projects and energy efficiency initiatives.\n\n**Long-term goals (2030-2050):**\n1. **Transition to a low-carbon economy:**\n\t* Achieve net-zero greenhouse gas emissions from fossil fuels by 2050.\n\t* Develop a comprehensive plan for the transition, including strategies for industry, transportation, and energy production.\n2. **Invest in research and development:**\n\t* Continuously invest in research and development of new clean energy technologies and energy storage solutions.\n\t* Encourage innovation and entrepreneurship in the clean energy sector.\n\n**Implementation and monitoring:**\n\n1. **Establish', token_ids=[334, 21119, 369, 80569, 87266, 315, 435, 85061, 30353, 2053, 57277, 334, 38255, 25, 1035, 791, 7859, 54180, 389, 31376, 40373, 706, 6197, 311, 5199, 12434, 10742, 11, 2737, 10182, 2349, 11, 3805, 25793, 11, 323, 92948, 315, 5933, 5070, 13, 2057, 50460, 1521, 4819, 11, 433, 374, 7718, 311, 8108, 1057, 15652, 315, 31376, 40373, 323, 9320, 311, 32981, 11, 810, 22556, 4907, 8336, 13, 1115, 3197, 50729, 264, 16195, 8446, 311, 11322, 264, 5199, 14278, 304, 31376, 10633, 15652, 382, 334, 12755, 9860, 9021, 320, 2366, 18, 12, 2366, 20, 