. If yes, what type of bicycle did you own (e.g., road bike, mountain bike, hybrid bike)?\n\t* _______________________________________________________\n3. How often do you ride a bicycle?\n\t* Daily\n\t* Several times a week\n\t* Occasionally\n\t* Rarely\n\t* Never\n\n**Section 3: Product Features**\n\n1. How important is the following feature to you when choosing a bicycle?\n\t* Comfortable seat\n\t* Adjustable handlebars\n\t* Wide tires\n\t* Lightweight frame\n\t* Other (please specify)\n\t* Not important at all\n2. How would you rate the overall design of our beginner-friendly bicycle?\n\t* Excellent\n\t* Good\n\t* Fair\n\t* Poor\n\t* Very poor\n\n**Section 4: Performance**\n\n1. How would you rate the performance of our beginner-friendly bicycle?\n\t* Excellent\n\t* Good\n\t* Fair\n\t* Poor\n\t* Very poor\n2. How easy was it to assemble and adjust the bicycle?\n\t* Very easy\n\t* Somewhat easy\n\t* Neutral\n\t* Somewhat difficult\n\t* Very difficult\n\n**Section 5: Satisfaction**\n\n1. How satisfied are you with your overall experience with our beginner-friendly bicycle?\n\t* Extremely satisfied\n\t* Somewhat satisfied\n\t* Neutral\n\t* Somewhat dissatisfied\n\t* Extremely dissatisfied\n2.', token_ids=[334, 1110, 53999, 24507, 25, 76685, 12557, 10901, 84996, 389, 279, 1561, 93275, 7424, 18260, 79447, 57277, 334, 38255, 25, 1035, 13359, 499, 369, 13126, 1057, 502, 50048, 22658, 36086, 0, 1226, 907, 701, 9647, 323, 1053, 1093, 311, 9762, 701, 11555, 389, 420, 502, 2027, 13, 4718, 11302, 690, 1520, 603, 7417, 323, 46464, 1057, 2027, 311, 2731, 3449, 279, 3966, 315, 1057, 6444, 13, 5321, 1935, 264, 2478, 4520, 311, 4686, 420, 10795, 323, 4430, 701, 10978, 18463, 382, 334, 9817, 220, 16, 25, 4829, 45245, 57277, 16, 13, 3639, 374, 701, 4325, 2134, 5380, 197, 9, 220, 972, 12, 1187, 198, 197, 9, 220, 914, 12, 1958, 198, 197, 9, 220, 1758, 12, 2096, 198, 197, 9, 220, 1774, 12, 4370, 198, 197, 9, 220, 2131, 477, 9191, 198, 17, 13, 3639, 374, 701, 10026, 5380, 197, 9, 1996