Output~2025-04-07 00:18:46.886730: [RequestOutput(request_id=961, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Given a task, summarize the steps for a user to perform it. ### Input: Task: Clean a whiteboard ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 16644, 264, 3465, 11, 63179, 279, 7504, 369, 264, 1217, 311, 2804, 433, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 5546, 25, 9785, 264, 4251, 2541, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here are the steps to clean a whiteboard:\n\n**Step 1: Gather necessary materials**\n\n* A soft, dry cloth (microfiber cloth recommended)\n* A gentle cleaning solution (whiteboard cleaner or a mixture of equal parts water and white vinegar)\n* A small bucket or container for mixing the cleaning solution\n* A dry cloth or paper towel for drying\n\n**Step 2: Remove any loose debris**\n\n* Use the dry cloth to gently sweep across the whiteboard to remove any loose crumbs, dust, or debris.\n\n**Step 3: Mix the cleaning solution**\n\n* In the bucket or container, mix the cleaning solution according to the manufacturer's instructions (if using a commercial cleaner) or combine equal parts water and white vinegar.\n\n**Step 4: Apply the cleaning solution**\n\n* Dip the soft cloth into the cleaning solution, wring it out thoroughly, and apply it to the whiteboard. Make sure to cover the entire surface evenly.\n\n**Step 5: Wipe down the whiteboard**\n\n* Gently wipe the whiteboard in a circular motion, starting from the top and working your way down. Make sure to cover the entire surface.\n\n**Step 6: Remove any remaining streaks or residue**\n\n* Use a dry cloth or paper towel to wipe down the whiteboard and remove any remaining streaks or residue.\n\n**Step 7: Dry the whiteboard**\n\n* Use a dry cloth or paper towel to wipe down the whiteboard one more time to remove any excess moisture.\n\n**Step 8: Inspect and repeat if necessary**\n\n* Inspect the whiteboard to ensure it is clean and free of streaks or residue. If necessary, repeat the cleaning process to achieve the desired level of cleanliness.\n\nBy following these steps, you should be able to effectively clean your whiteboard and remove any marks, stains, or residue.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 279, 7504, 311, 4335, 264, 4251, 2541, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 50095, 5995, 7384, 57277, 9, 362, 8579, 11, 9235, 28392, 320, 41543, 84045, 28392, 11349, 340, 9, 362, 22443, 16204, 6425, 320, 5902, 2541, 32981, 477, 264, 21655, 315, 6273, 5596, 3090, 323, 4251, 47205, 340, 9, 362, 2678, 15994, 477, 5593, 369, 27890, 279, 16204, 6425, 198, 9, 362, 9235, 28392, 477, 5684, 43713, 369, 46479, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 11016, 904, 20784, 35098, 57277, 9, 5560, 279, 9235, 28392, 311, 30373, 24021, 4028, 279, 4251, 2541, 311, 4148, 904, 20784, 97677, 11, 16174, 11, 477, 35098, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 19771, 279, 16204, 6425, 57277, 9, 763, 279, 15994, 477, 5593, 11, 6651, 279, 16204, 6425, 4184, 311, 279, 14290, 596, 11470, 320, 333, 1701, 264, 8518, 32981, 8, 477, 16343, 6273, 5596, 3090, 323, 4251, 47205, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 21194, 279, 16204, 6425, 57277, 9, 56147, 279, 8579, 28392, 1139, 279, 16204, 6425, 11, 3189, 287, 433, 704, 27461, 11, 323, 3881, 433, 311, 279, 4251, 2541, 13, 7557, 2771, 311, 3504, 279, 4553, 7479, 42147, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 468, 3527, 1523, 279, 4251, 2541, 57277, 9, 480, 4501, 40194, 279, 4251, 2541, 304, 264, 28029, 11633, 11, 6041, 505