Output~2025-04-07 00:19:42.385354: [RequestOutput(request_id=978, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Suggest a wedding dress for a summer outdoor ceremony ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 328, 3884, 264, 13306, 8679, 369, 264, 7474, 16166, 22260, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="What a lovely task!\n\nFor a summer outdoor ceremony, I would suggest a wedding dress that exudes elegance, sophistication, and a touch of whimsy to match the carefree spirit of the season. Here's a dreamy dress that would be perfect for the occasion:\n\n**Dress Style:** A flowing, strapless, lace mermaid gown with a sweetheart neckline and a dramatic train.\n\n**Fabric:** Lightweight, ivory-colored silk or organza with intricate lace details and subtle beading to catch the sunlight.\n\n**Color:** Soft, creamy ivory or champagne, which will complement the natural beauty of the outdoor setting and the warm summer sun.\n\n**Features:**\n\n* A delicate, beaded belt at the natural waist to accentuate the bride's curves and add a touch of glamour.\n* A flowing, layered skirt that will catch the breeze and create a romantic, ethereal effect.\n* A dramatic, cascading train that will add drama and romance to the overall look.\n* A delicate, lace trim along the neckline and hem to add a touch of whimsy and romance.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n* A delicate, beaded headpiece or a floral crown to add a touch of whimsy and romance to the overall look.\n* A pair of statement earrings, such as a pair of dangling pearls or a delicate, beaded design, to add a touch of glamour.\n* A pair of high heels or sandals with a delicate, beaded or lace trim to add a touch of elegance to the overall look.\n\n**Why it's perfect for a summer outdoor ceremony:**\n\n* The lightweight, breathable fabric will keep the bride cool and comfortable in the warm summer sun.\n* The flowing, strapless design will allow the bride to feel free and carefree, perfect for an outdoor ceremony.\n* The delicate, lace details and beading will catch the sunlight and add a touch of romance and whimsy to the overall look.\n* The dramatic train will add a touch of drama and romance to the ceremony, making it a truly unforgettable moment.\n\nOverall, this dress is a perfect choice for a summer outdoor ceremony, as it combines elegance, sophistication, and a touch of whimsy to create a truly unforgettable look.", token_ids=[3923, 264, 17104, 3465, 2268, 2520, 264, 7474, 16166, 22260, 11, 358, 1053, 4284, 264, 13306, 8679, 430, 506, 29246, 64543, 11, 85536, 11, 323, 264, 5916, 315, 70205, 88, 311, 2489, 279, 2512, 10816, 9090, 315, 279, 3280, 13, 5810, 596, 264, 8063, 88, 8679, 430, 1053, 387, 4832, 369, 279, 13402, 1473, 334, 35, 676, 12179, 68063, 362, 36612, 11, 34647, 1752, 11, 46793, 4809, 46342, 65510, 449, 264, 92354, 92661, 323, 264, 22520, 5542, 382, 334, 82831, 68063, 84367, 11, 70916, 58822, 41044, 477, 2942, 4458, 449, 57216, 46793, 3649, 323, 27545, 387, 2277, 311, 2339, 279, 40120, 382, 334, 1668, 68063, 25046, 11, 47985, 70916, 477, 65393, 11, 902, 690, 23606, 279, 5933, 13444, 315, 279, 16166, 6376, 323, 279, 8369, 7474, 7160, 382, 334, 22043, 25, 57277, 9, 362, 36301, 11, 387, 14589, 19671, 520, 279, 5933, 29142, 311, 30200, 6426, 279, 42447, 596, 37033, 323, 923, 264, 5916, 315, 80049, 627, 9, 362, 36612, 11, 64241, 38380, 430, 690, 2339, 279, 46385, 323, 1893, 264, 24364, 11, 8537, 44353, 2515, 627, 9, 362, 22520, 11, 76057, 2277, 5542, 430, 690, 923, 20156, 323, 30363, 311,