Output~2025-04-07 00:20:03.980647: [RequestOutput(request_id=993, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Speak more eloquently about this experience ### Input: I went roller skating with my friends ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 68301, 810, 64235, 447, 4501, 922, 420, 3217, 17010, 5688, 25, 358, 4024, 29551, 65504, 449, 856, 4885, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='The thrill of gliding across the rink, the rush of adrenaline as I effortlessly navigated the twists and turns, and the infectious laughter of my friends as we shared in the joy of the experience - our roller skating adventure was a truly unforgettable escapade.\n\nAs we laced up our skates and stepped onto the rink, the excitement was palpable. The music pulsed through the air, setting the tone for a fun-filled afternoon of carefree revelry. My friends and I exchanged grins, our eyes sparkling with anticipation as we prepared to unleash our inner child and let loose on the wheels.\n\nThe first few laps were a bit rocky, as we found our footing and regained our balance. But soon, we were gliding effortlessly, our strides lengthening as we gained confidence. The wind whipped through our hair, and the sun shone down upon us, casting a warm glow over the entire scene.\n\nAs we skated, we chatted and laughed, sharing stories and jokes as we went. The rink became our own personal playground, where we could let our hair down and be ourselves. We played games, like "chase" and "tag," and even attempted a few daring tricks, our hearts pounding with excitement as we took risks and pushed our limits.\n\nBut even as we reveled in the thrill of the moment, we also took time to appreciate the beauty of the surroundings. The rink\'s colorful lights twinkled like diamonds, and the sound system pumped out a lively beat that seemed to match the rhythm of our hearts. It was as if we were one with the music, our movements in perfect harmony with the pulsating bass and treble.\n\nAs the afternoon drew to a close, we reluctantly made our way off the rink, our legs aching and our faces flushed with excitement. But even as we said our goodbyes and headed our separate ways, we all knew that this was an experience we would cherish for a long time to come - a carefree, joyful, and unforgettable afternoon of roller skating with friends.', token_ids=[791, 54904, 315, 2840, 6714, 4028, 279, 436, 771, 11, 279, 13270, 315, 79492, 439, 358, 69704, 34512, 660, 279, 62990, 323, 10800, 11, 323, 279, 50600, 43214, 315, 856, 4885, 439, 584, 6222, 304, 279, 16267, 315, 279, 3217, 482, 1057, 29551, 65504, 18427, 574, 264, 9615, 61098, 89884, 1037, 382, 2170, 584, 326, 4535, 709, 1057, 1940, 988, 323, 25319, 8800, 279, 436, 771, 11, 279, 28361, 574, 75649, 481, 13, 578, 4731, 7893, 32424, 1555, 279, 3805, 11, 6376, 279, 16630, 369, 264, 2523, 44518, 13658, 315, 2512, 10816, 22899, 894, 13, 3092, 4885, 323, 358, 48501, 1099, 1354, 11, 1057, 6548, 64612, 449, 50919, 439, 584, 10235, 311, 78535, 1057, 9358, 1716, 323, 1095, 20784, 389, 279, 23529, 382, 791, 1176, 2478, 51055, 1051, 264, 2766, 56617, 11, 439, 584, 1766, 1057, 74503, 323, 86025, 1057, 8335, 13, 2030, 5246, 11, 584, 1051, 2840, 6714, 69704, 11, 1057, 37387, 3160, 6147, 439, 584, 18661, 12410, 13, 578, 10160, 64357, 1555, 1057, 7013, 11, 323, 279, 7160, 559, 606, 1523, 5304, 603, 11, 25146, 264, 8369, 37066, 927, 279, 4553, 6237