their intense winds and debris, while hurricanes cause damage through storm surges, flooding, and strong winds.\n\n**Warning Time**: Tornadoes often have little to no warning time, while hurricanes typically have several days of warning time, allowing for evacuations and preparations.\n\nThese are the main differences between a tornado and a hurricane.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2077, 430, 45695, 279, 1715, 1473, 791, 1925, 12062, 1990, 264, 45272, 323, 264, 49784, 527, 1473, 334, 4812, 96618, 350, 64043, 288, 12446, 927, 4363, 11, 11383, 304, 279, 3723, 4273, 11, 1418, 90127, 12446, 927, 3090, 11, 6118, 304, 279, 23179, 22302, 11, 35374, 15379, 11, 323, 27945, 315, 12550, 382, 334, 60558, 96618, 350, 64043, 288, 1376, 994, 264, 10824, 315, 45475, 4787, 2586, 3871, 11, 2737, 8369, 11, 21147, 3805, 3221, 279, 7479, 11, 36921, 3805, 3485, 11, 323, 10160, 65344, 13, 89603, 1376, 927, 8369, 18435, 21160, 994, 279, 9581, 7479, 9499, 374, 520, 3325, 220, 1627, 13, 20, 32037, 320, 1490, 59572, 705, 323, 279, 16975, 374, 45311, 382, 334, 1730, 96618, 350, 64043, 288, 527, 12309, 2678, 11, 6118, 24950, 505, 264, 2478, 7693, 311, 264, 2478, 7895, 7693, 304, 23899, 11, 1418, 90127, 649, 387, 11758, 315, 8931, 7029, 323, 1317, 382, 334, 13242, 96618, 350, 64043, 288, 527, 2875, 62954, 11, 11383, 29869, 505, 264, 2478, 6622, 311, 264, 2478, 4520, 11, 1418, 90127, 649, 1566, 369, 2919, 477, 1524, 5672, 382, 334, 59918, 15535, 96618, 350, 64043, 288, 617, 9193, 1579, 10160, 25753, 11, 3629, 19261, 709, 311, 220, 3101, 8931, 824, 6596, 320, 11738, 13437, 7682, 705, 1418, 90127, 617, 29493, 10160, 25753, 11, 11383, 24950, 505, 220, 5728, 311, 220, 10895, 8931, 824, 6596, 320, 9079, 311, 220, 14022, 13437, 7682, 3677, 334, 25246, 96618, 350, 64043, 288, 5353, 5674, 1555, 872, 19428, 29592, 323, 35098, 11, 1418, 90127, 5353, 5674, 1555, 13766, 1765, 4282, 11, 39262, 11, 323, 3831, 29592, 382, 334, 12358, 4212, 96618, 350, 64043, 288, 3629, 617, 2697, 311, 912, 10163, 892, 11, 1418, 