s Can Help You Achieve Optimal Health and Happiness"\n\nThese titles highlight the various benefits of a plant-based diet, including its impact on health, the environment, and overall wellbeing.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 264, 2478, 3284, 15671, 369, 459, 4652, 430, 35434, 279, 7720, 315, 264, 6136, 6108, 10173, 1473, 16, 13, 330, 791, 7997, 22910, 25, 58530, 287, 279, 7572, 315, 264, 18317, 61439, 27304, 702, 17, 13, 330, 89711, 4718, 12424, 311, 24327, 6401, 25, 578, 8242, 34754, 39195, 315, 264, 18317, 61439, 69256, 702, 18, 13, 330, 791, 18317, 61439, 71459, 25, 2650, 264, 27304, 8269, 304, 43800, 4893, 323, 435, 68998, 3053, 15583, 4718, 14285, 323, 23754, 702, 19, 13, 330, 3915, 18945, 311, 6771, 25, 578, 25027, 323, 6401, 39195, 315, 264, 18317, 61439, 27304, 702, 20, 13, 330, 791, 12781, 315, 12369, 25, 8595, 264, 18317, 61439, 27304, 374, 279, 5422, 311, 264, 61593, 323, 44454, 56096, 702, 21, 13, 330, 791, 18317, 61439, 12761, 25, 2650, 264, 27304, 8269, 304, 50298, 3053, 11736, 1472, 61789, 16923, 11, 34507, 12634, 11, 323, 65184, 4718, 28993, 8489, 35214, 702, 22, 13, 330, 791, 7572, 315, 50298, 25, 58530, 287, 279, 18878, 37842, 323, 25027, 39195, 315, 264, 18317, 61439, 27304, 702, 23, 13, 330, 791, 18317, 61439, 27304, 22910, 25, 2650, 264, 27304, 8269, 304, 43800, 4893, 11, 435, 68998, 11, 323, 41593, 2895, 1771, 3053, 15583, 4718, 6401, 323, 279, 29935, 702, 24, 13, 330, 791, 7997, 31403, 13756, 25, 2650, 264, 18317, 61439, 27304, 3053, 65184, 4718, 6401, 11, 279, 11847, 11, 323, 4718, 9983, 29680, 702, 605, 13, 330, 791, 18317, 61439, 8092, 311, 61283, 25, 2650, 264, 27304, 8269, 304, 50298, 3053, 11736, 1472, 42224, 588, 16963, 2931, 6401, 323, 79244, 1875, 9673, 15671, 11415, 279, 5370, 7720, 315, 264, 6136, 6108, 10173, 11, 2737, 1202, 5536, 389, 2890, 11, 279, 4676, 11, 323, 8244, 57930, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=Non