 the logo on the left and the navigation menu on the right.\n* The search bar is placed to the right of the navigation menu, also aligned horizontally.\n* The rest of the screen is reserved for the main content area, which will display the relevant information or features depending on the user\'s actions.\n\n**Color Scheme**\n\n* Primary color: A bright and energetic blue (#03A9F4)\n* Secondary color: A neutral gray (#F7F7F7)\n* Accent color: A deep orange (#FFC107)\n\n**Typography**\n\n* Font family: Open Sans\n* Font size: 16px\n* Font weight: Regular\n\nThis design aims to provide a clean and modern look, with a clear hierarchy of elements and sufficient whitespace to make the interface easy to navigate. The logo and navigation menu are prominent and easily accessible, while the search bar provides a convenient way for users to find specific information.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 4754, 3241, 1217, 3834, 2955, 430, 20628, 279, 29803, 1473, 334, 4137, 11360, 57277, 9, 31152, 25, 362, 49304, 1534, 12708, 315, 279, 2883, 836, 330, 36, 13933, 17940, 1, 304, 264, 6617, 3381, 11, 9277, 304, 279, 1948, 8109, 9309, 315, 279, 4264, 627, 9, 18464, 9937, 512, 197, 10, 330, 18219, 1, 320, 2414, 98551, 11, 14265, 3381, 340, 197, 10, 330, 7516, 1, 320, 2414, 98551, 11, 14265, 3381, 340, 197, 10, 330, 12978, 1, 320, 2414, 98551, 11, 14265, 3381, 340, 9, 7694, 4821, 25, 362, 4382, 1495, 1988, 2115, 449, 264, 8622, 7922, 9168, 4706, 520, 279, 842, 11, 9277, 304, 279, 1948, 6840, 9309, 315, 279, 4264, 382, 334, 2224, 57277, 9, 578, 4342, 3857, 5097, 709, 264, 8521, 2673, 315, 220, 1135, 1804, 627, 9, 578, 12708, 323, 10873, 5130, 527, 27210, 59988, 11, 449, 279, 12708, 389, 279, 2163, 323, 279, 10873, 5130, 389, 279, 1314, 627, 9, 578, 2778, 3703, 374, 9277, 311, 279, 1314, 315, 279, 10873, 5130, 11, 1101, 27210, 59988, 627, 9, 578, 2800, 315, 279, 4264, 374, 4694, 369, 279, 1925, 2262, 3158, 11, 902, 690, 3113, 279, 9959, 2038, 477, 4519, 11911, 389, 279, 1217, 596, 6299, 382, 