Output~2025-04-07 00:27:19.458380: [RequestOutput(request_id=1167, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Let a_1,a_2,… be a sequence determined by the rule a_n= (a_n-1)/2 if a_n-1 is even and a_n=3a_n-1+1 if a_n-1 is odd. For how many positive integers a_1 ≤ 2008 is it true that a_1 is less than each of a_2, a_3, and a_4? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 6914, 264, 62, 16, 15362, 62, 17, 99313, 387, 264, 8668, 11075, 555, 279, 6037, 264, 1107, 28, 320, 64, 1107, 12, 16, 5738, 17, 422, 264, 1107, 12, 16, 374, 1524, 323, 264, 1107, 28, 18, 64, 1107, 12, 16, 10, 16, 422, 264, 1107, 12, 16, 374, 10535, 13, 1789, 1268, 1690, 6928, 26864, 264, 62, 16, 38394, 220, 1049, 23, 374, 433, 837, 430, 264, 62, 16, 374, 2753, 1109, 1855, 315, 264, 62, 17, 11, 264, 62, 18, 11, 323, 264, 62, 19, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Let's analyze the sequence:\n\n* If $a_1$ is even, then $a_2 = \\frac{a_1}{2}$, which is also even.\n* If $a_1$ is odd, then $a_2 = 3a_1 + 1$, which is also odd.\n\nSo, the sequence alternates between even and odd terms.\n\nNow, let's consider the possible values of $a_1$:\n\n* If $a_1 = 1$, then $a_2 = 3a_1 + 1 = 4$, $a_3 = \\frac{a_2}{2} = 2$, and $a_4 = 3a_3 + 1 = 7$. Since $a_1 < a_2, a_3, a_4$, this sequence works.\n* If $a_1 = 2$, then $a_2 = \\frac{a_1}{2} = 1$, $a_3 = 3a_2 + 1 = 4$, and $a_4 = \\frac{a_3}{2} = 2$. Since $a_1 < a_2, a_3, a_4$, this sequence works.\n* If $a_1 = 3$, then $a_2 = 3a_1 + 1 = 10$, $a_3 = \\frac{a_2}{2} = 5$, and $a_4 = 3a_3 + 1 = 16$. Since $a_1 > a_2, a_3, a_4$, this sequence does not work.\n* If $a_1 = 4$, then $a_2 = \\frac{a_1}{2} = 2$, $a_3 = 3a_2 + 1 = 7$, and $a_4 = \\frac{a_3}{2} = 3.5$. Since $a_1 > a_2, a_3, a_4$, this sequence does not work.\n\nWe can continue this process to find that the only values of $a_1$ that work are $1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024, 2048$. There are $\\boxed{12}$ such", token_ids=[10267, 596, 24564, 279, 8668, 1473, 9, 1442, 400, 64, 62, 16, 3, 374, 1524, 11, 1243, 400, 64, 62, 17, 284, 1144, 38118, 90, 64, 62, 16, 15523, 17, 32816, 11, 902, 374, 1101, 1524, 627, 9, 1442, 400, 64, 62, 16, 3, 374, 10535, 11, 1243, 400, 64, 62, 17, 284, 220, 18, 64, 62, 16, 489, 220, 16, 55976, 902, 374, 1101, 10535, 382, 4516, 11, 279, 8668, 7064, 988, 1990, 1524, 323, 10535, 3878, 382, 7184, 11, 1095, 596, 2980, 279, 3284, 2819, 315, 400, 64, 62, 16, 3, 1473, 9, 1442, 400, 64, 62, 16, 284, 220, 16, 55976, 1243, 400, 64, 62, 17, 284, 220, 18, 64, 62, 16, 489, 220, 16, 284, 220, 19, 55976, 400, 64, 62, 18, 284, 1144, 38118, 90, 64, 62, 17, 15523, 17, 92, 284, 220, 17, 55976, 323, 400, 64, 62, 19, 284, 220, 18, 64, 62, 18, 489, 220, 16, 284, 220, 22, 13244, 8876, 400, 64, 62, 16, 366, 264, 62, 17, 11, 264, 62, 18, 11, 264, 62, 19, 55976, 420, 8668, 4375, 627, 9, 1442, 400, 64, 62, 16, 284, 220, 17, 55976, 1243, 400, 64, 62, 17, 284, 1144, 38118, 90, 64, 62, 16, 15523, 17, 92, 284, 220, 16, 55976, 400, 64, 62, 18, 284, 220, 18, 64, 62, 17, 489, 220, 16, 284, 220, 19, 55976, 323, 400, 64, 62, 19, 284, 1144, 38118, 90, 64, 62, 18, 15523, 17, 92, 284, 220, 17, 13244, 8876, 400, 64, 62, 16, 366, 264, 62, 17, 11, 264, 62, 18, 11, 264, 62, 19, 55976, 420, 8668, 4375, 627, 9, 1442, 400, 64, 62, 16, 284, 220, 18, 55976, 1243, 400, 64, 62, 17, 284, 220, 18, 64, 62, 16, 489, 220, 16, 284, 220, 605, 55976, 400, 64, 62, 18, 284, 1144, 38118, 90, 64, 62, 17, 15523, 17, 92, 284, 220, 20, 55976, 323, 400, 64, 62, 19, 284, 220, 18, 64, 62, 18, 489, 220, 16, 284, 220, 845, 13244, 8876, 400, 64, 62, 16, 871, 264, 62, 17, 11, 264, 62, 18, 11, 264, 62, 19, 55976, 420, 8668, 1587, 539, 990, 627, 9, 1442, 400, 64, 62, 16, 284, 220, 19, 55976, 1243, 400, 64, 62, 17, 284, 1144, 38118, 90, 64, 62, 16, 15523, 17, 92, 284, 220, 17, 55976, 400, 64, 62, 18, 284, 220, 18, 64, 62, 17, 489, 220, 16, 284, 220, 22, 55976, 323, 400, 64, 62, 19, 284, 1144, 38118, 90, 64, 62, 18, 15523, 17, 92, 284, 220, 18, 13, 20, 13244, 8876, 400, 64, 62, 16, 871, 264, 62, 17, 11, 264, 62, 18, 11, 264, 62, 19, 55976, 420, 8668, 1587, 539, 990, 382, 1687, 649, 3136, 420, 1920, 311, 1505, 430, 279, 1193, 2819, 315, 400, 64, 62, 16, 3, 430, 990, 527, 400, 16, 11, 220, 17, 11, 220, 19, 11, 220, 23, 11, 220, 845, 11, 220, 843, 11, 220, 1227, 11, 220, 4386, 11, 220, 4146, 11, 220, 8358, 11, 220, 4278, 19, 11, 220, 7854, 23, 13244, 2684, 527, 59060, 80175, 90, 717, 32816, 1778], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=length, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
