r referrals.\n\n6. **Price Tracker**: An app that tracks prices for products across multiple online retailers, alerting users when prices drop or when products go on sale.\n\n7. **Digital Product Demonstrations**: An app that provides interactive, 3D product demonstrations for complex products, such as electronics or home appliances, to help users better understand their features and functionality.\n\n8. **Loyalty Program**: An app that rewards users for their purchases, with features like points redemption, exclusive discounts, and personalized offers.\n\n9. **Product Comparison**: An app that allows users to compare products across different retailers, with features like side-by-side comparisons, price matching, and product reviews.\n\n10. **In-Store Navigation**: An app that helps users navigate physical stores, with features like store maps, product location tracking, and personalized shopping routes.\n\n11. **Digital Coupons**: An app that provides users with digital coupons, discounts, and promotions, with features like automatic coupon clipping and redemption.\n\n12. **Product Reviews and Ratings**: An app that allows users to leave reviews and ratings for products, with features like product ranking, review filtering, and personalized recommendations based on user preferences.\n\n13. **Wish List**: An app that allows users to create and manage their wish lists, with features like automatic price tracking, product recommendations, and reminders for when products go on sale.\n\n14. **Digital Gift Registry**: An app that allows users to create and manage digital gift registries, with features like gift suggestions", token_ids=[8586, 527, 1063, 18699, 917, 6848, 369, 264, 7528, 3637, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 34126, 27738, 33936, 96618, 1556, 917, 430, 6276, 3932, 311, 8298, 9364, 315, 872, 17895, 3673, 323, 1893, 264, 4200, 46846, 13, 14969, 649, 1243, 21907, 1456, 389, 48374, 11, 6651, 9976, 46804, 9863, 11, 323, 1524, 636, 42428, 19075, 3196, 389, 872, 19882, 323, 