e table, a side table, and even as a makeshift desk for my laptop. It\'s been a game-changer for my daily routine, and I can\'t imagine going back to my old, cluttered setup.\n\nOverall, I\'m thoroughly impressed with the MALM side table and would highly recommend it to anyone in the market for a stylish and functional piece of furniture. The price is unbeatable, and the quality is top-notch. Five stars isn\'t enough - I\'d give it ten stars if I could!"', token_ids=[8586, 596, 264, 26569, 12700, 3477, 369, 279, 85464, 32, 3185, 2007, 1473, 334, 20, 14, 20, 9958, 57277, 7189, 2846, 11112, 44898, 449, 856, 502, 89139, 44, 3185, 2007, 505, 85464, 32, 0, 358, 574, 264, 2766, 44929, 922, 12096, 264, 6710, 315, 14891, 2930, 11, 719, 358, 2846, 779, 16089, 358, 3952, 279, 67678, 13, 578, 2007, 11721, 6288, 323, 574, 17235, 4228, 311, 42840, 482, 358, 574, 3025, 311, 636, 433, 743, 709, 304, 1234, 220, 966, 4520, 13, 578, 11470, 1051, 2867, 323, 64694, 11, 323, 279, 9863, 5052, 3871, 61440, 382, 791, 2007, 5196, 374, 45652, 323, 1664, 27975, 11, 449, 264, 48494, 323, 6617, 2955, 430, 18809, 14268, 449, 856, 5496, 3130, 10799, 13, 578, 7479, 374, 11113, 323, 4228, 311, 4335, 11, 323, 279, 14535, 527, 45652, 323, 2834, 956, 19307, 856, 51645, 27035, 13, 358, 3077, 2736, 1047, 3892, 4885, 323, 3070, 3697, 4068, 389, 1268, 2294, 433, 5992, 11, 323, 358, 3077, 4036, 28701, 72739, 389, 856, 364, 25894, 261, 6, 12945, 382, 4054, 315, 279, 2574, 430, 2216, 25408, 757, 922, 420, 2007, 374, 1202, 60112, 13, 358, 3077, 1511, 433, 439, 264, 11033, 2007, 11, 264, 3185, 2007, 11, 323, 1524, 439, 264, 87180, 18496, 369, 856, 21288, 13, 1102, 596, 1027, 264, 1847, 11843, 4091, 369, 856, 7446, 14348, 11, 323, 358, 649, 956, 13085, 2133, 1203, 311, 856, 2362, 11, 54916, 291, 6642, 382, 28589, 11, 358, 2846, 27461, 25408, 449, 279, 89139, 44, 3185, 2007, 323, 1053, 7701, 7079, 433, 311, 5606, 304, 279, 3157, 369, 264, 32461, 323, 16003, 6710, 315, 14891, 13, 578, 3430, 374, 66671, 15436, 11,