i in range(len(flowerbed)):\n        if flowerbed[i] == 0 and (i == 0 or flowerbed[i-1] == 0) and (i == len(flowerbed) - 1 or flowerbed[i+1] == 0):\n            flowerbed[i] = 1\n            count += 1\n    return count >= n\n```\n\nThis function iterates over the flowerbed and checks if a flower can be planted at each position. It checks if the current plot is empty and if the adjacent plots are also empty. If this condition is met, it plants a flower at that position and increments the count. Finally, it returns whether the count of planted flowers is greater than or equal to n.\n\nFor example, if the input is `flowerbed = [1,0,0,0,0,0,1], n = 2`, the function will return `True` because 2 new flowers can be planted in the flowerbed without violating the no-adjacent-flowers rule.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 13325, 6425, 369, 279, 3575, 1473, 14196, 4077, 755, 649, 35648, 5191, 16345, 968, 15115, 2788, 11, 308, 997, 262, 1797, 284, 220, 15, 198, 262, 369, 602, 304, 2134, 7046, 968, 15115, 2788, 10162, 286, 422, 23153, 2788, 1004, 60, 624, 220, 15, 323, 320, 72, 624, 220, 15, 477, 23153, 2788, 1004, 12, 16, 60, 624, 220, 15, 8, 323, 320, 72, 624, 2479, 968, 15115, 2788, 8, 482, 220, 16, 477, 23153, 2788, 1004, 10, 16, 60, 624, 220, 15, 997, 310, 23153, 2788, 1004, 60, 284, 220, 16, 198, 310, 1797, 1447, 220, 16, 198, 262, 471, 1797, 2669, 308, 198, 14196, 19884, 2028, 734, 5480, 988, 927, 279, 23153, 2788, 323, 12621, 422, 264, 23153, 649, 387, 39441, 520, 1855, 2361, 13, 1102, 12621, 422, 279, 1510, 7234, 374, 4384, 323, 422, 279, 24894, 31794, 527, 1101, 4384, 13, 1442, 420, 3044, 374, 2322, 11, 433, 11012, 264, 23153, 520, 430, 2361, 323, 62700, 279, 1797, 13, 17830, 11, 433, 4780, 3508, 279, 1797, 315, 39441, 19837, 374, 7191, 1109, 477, 6273, 311, 308, 382, 2520, 3187, 11, 422, 279, 1988, 374, 1595, 39853, 2788, 284, 510, 16, 11, 15, 11, 15, 11, 15, 11, 15, 11, 15, 11, 16, 1145, 308, 284, 220, 17, 7964, 279, 734, 690, 471, 1595, 2575, 63, 1606, 220, 17, 502, 19837, 649, 387, 39441, 304, 279, 23153, 2788, 2085, 45462, 279, 912, 12, 25770, 18680, 62413, 388, 6037, 13, 128009], cumulative_logprob=None, logprobs=None, finish_reason=stop, stop_reason=None)], finished=True, metrics=None, lora_request=None, num_cached_tokens=None, multi_modal_placeholders={})]
