Output~2025-04-07 00:29:59.616080: [RequestOutput(request_id=1229, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Create a set of rules for the game of hangman. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 4324, 264, 743, 315, 5718, 369, 279, 1847, 315, 15020, 1543, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a set of rules for the game of hangman:\n\n**Number of Players:** 2 or more\n\n**Objective:** One player thinks of a word, and the other player tries to guess the word by suggesting letters. For each letter that is not in the word, the first player draws a part of a hangman\'s gallows. The game continues until the word is guessed or the gallows is complete and the player who is guessing the word is "hanged."\n\n**How to Play:**\n\n1. **Choosing the Word:** The player who is thinking of the word is called the "word picker." The word picker chooses a word and writes down a series of underscores to represent each letter of the word.\n2. **Guessing Letters:** The other player, called the "guesser," tries to guess a letter. The word picker tells the guesser if the letter appears in the word or not. If the letter appears in the word, the word picker fills in the corresponding underscore(s) with the letter. If the letter does not appear in the word, the word picker draws a part of the hangman\'s gallows.\n3. **Drawing the Gallows:** The gallows is drawn as a series of lines and shapes. Each incorrect guess adds a new part to the gallows. The gallows is complete when the hangman is "hanged."\n4. **Winning the Game:** The game is won when the guesser correctly guesses the word, or when the gallows is complete and the guesser is "hanged."\n5. **Scoring:** The game can be played for points, with each correct guess earning a certain number of points and each incorrect guess losing a certain number of points.\n6. **Gameplay:** The game continues until the word is guessed or the gallows is complete. The player who wins the game gets to be the word picker for the next round.\n\n**Hangman\'s Gallows:**\n\n* Head: _______\n* Body: _______\n* Left Arm: _______\n* Right Arm: _______\n* Left Leg: _______\n* Right Leg: _______\n* Rope: _______\n\n**Penalties:**\n\n* Each incorrect guess adds a part to the gallows.\n* If the gallows is complete, the guesser is "hanged" and loses the game.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n* The word picker can give hints to the guesser to make the game easier or more challenging.\n* The guesser can use a strategy to try to guess the word', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 743, 315, 5718, 369, 279, 1847, 315, 15020, 1543, 1473, 334, 2903, 315, 25640, 68063, 220, 17, 477, 810, 271, 334, 79406, 68063, 3861, 2851, 15849, 315, 264, 3492, 11, 323, 279, 1023, 2851, 16696, 311, 8101, 279, 3492, 555, 23377, 12197, 13, 1789, 1855, 6661, 430, 374, 539, 304, 279, 3492, 11, 279, 1176, 2851, 27741, 264, 961, 315, 264, 15020, 1543, 596, 19754, 4336, 13, 578, 1847, 9731, 3156, 279, 3492, 374, 43410, 477, 279, 19754, 4336, 374, 4686, 323, 279, 2851, 889, 374, 47576, 279, 3492, 374, 330, 71, 3811, 2266, 334, 4438, 311, 7199, 25, 57277, 16, 13, 3146, 96144, 279, 9506, 68063, 578, 2851, 889, 374, 7422, 315, 279, 3492, 374, 2663, 279, 330, 1178, 32556, 1210, 578, 3492, 32556, 41011, 264, 3492, 323, 14238, 1523, 264, 4101, 315, 72890, 311, 4097, 1855, 6661, 315, 279, 3492, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 46830, 287, 45397, 68063, 578, 1023, 2851, 11, 2663, 279, 330, 8890, 37470, 1359, 16696, 311, 8101, 264, 6661, 13, 578, 3492, 32556, 10975, 279, 8101, 261, 422, 279, 66