raised bed or a series of raised beds to grow a variety of vegetables, such as tomatoes, carrots, and lettuce. Add a trellis for climbing plants like peas and beans.\n\n**6. Wildlife-Friendly Garden**: Incorporate plants that attract bees, butterflies, and birds, such as sunflowers, lavender, and coneflowers. Add a bird feeder or birdbath to attract wildlife.\n\n**7. Outdoor Living Space**: Create a seating area with a pergola or gazebo, surrounded by lush greenery and flowers. Add outdoor lighting and a fire pit for cozy gatherings.\n\n**8. Succulent Garden**: Plant a variety of succulents and cacti in a unique and visually appealing arrangement. This would be a great option for a low-maintenance garden.\n\n**9. Perennial Border**: Plant a mix of perennials, such as daylilies, hostas, and coneflowers, along the edges of the garden. This would create a beautiful and dynamic border.\n\n**10. Outdoor Art Installation**: Create a unique outdoor art installation using natural materials, such as stone, wood, or metal. This would add a touch of personality to the garden.\n\nThese are just a few ideas to get you started. Remember to consider your personal style, climate, and maintenance preferences when designing your garden. Happy gardening!', token_ids=[29815, 389, 279, 3984, 13863, 1404, 315, 220, 966, 76, 555, 220, 508, 76, 11, 1618, 527, 1063, 18921, 60299, 2447, 6848, 1473, 334, 16, 13, 80467, 19558, 7127, 96618, 4324, 264, 8045, 59402, 323, 34030, 13863, 449, 264, 8792, 1853, 11, 23712, 555, 63266, 52081, 305, 17327, 323, 23153, 28036, 13, 1115, 2955, 1053, 387, 4832, 369, 264, 8776, 477, 16287, 13863, 1742, 382, 334, 17, 13, 10164, 20595, 88391, 96618, 8012, 264, 2678, 36670, 477, 57713, 304, 279, 4219, 315, 279, 13863, 11, 23712, 555, 58367, 6307, 727, 323, 34966, 19837, 13, 1115, 1053, 1893, 264, 26733, 323, 78729, 16975, 382, 334, 18, 13, 74956, 19558, 96618, 64002, 279, 13863, 1139, 14491, 323, 6136, 264, 8205, 315, 42393, 11, 1778, 439, 68186, 11, 16392, 1563,