Output~2025-04-07 00:31:46.547808: [RequestOutput(request_id=1251, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Provide five tips for eating healthy. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 40665, 4330, 10631, 369, 12459, 9498, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here are five tips for eating healthy:\n\n**Tip 1: Eat a Balanced Diet**\nFocus on consuming a variety of foods from all food groups, including fruits, vegetables, whole grains, lean proteins, and healthy fats. Aim to include a rainbow of colors on your plate to ensure you're getting a range of essential nutrients.\n\n**Tip 2: Incorporate More Plant-Based Meals**\nPlant-based foods are rich in fiber, vitamins, and minerals, and can help reduce your risk of chronic diseases like heart disease and diabetes. Try incorporating more plant-based meals, such as salads, stir-fries, and veggie burgers, into your diet.\n\n**Tip 3: Watch Your Portion Sizes**\nEating large portions can lead to consuming more calories than you need, which can contribute to weight gain and other health problems. Pay attention to serving sizes and control your portions to maintain a healthy weight and reduce your risk of chronic diseases.\n\n**Tip 4: Limit Processed and Packaged Foods**\nProcessed and packaged foods are often high in added sugars, salt, and unhealthy fats, which can increase your risk of chronic diseases. Try to limit your consumption of these foods and opt for whole, unprocessed foods instead.\n\n**Tip 5: Stay Hydrated**\nDrinking enough water is essential for overall health, and can help with weight loss, digestion, and energy levels. Aim to drink at least eight glasses of water per day, and avoid sugary drinks like soda and juice that can have negative health effects.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 10631, 369, 12459, 9498, 1473, 334, 16394, 220, 16, 25, 45614, 264, 98209, 27304, 1035, 14139, 389, 35208, 264, 8205, 315, 15657, 505, 682, 3691, 5315, 11, 2737, 26390, 11, 24822, 11, 4459, 41936, 11, 16025, 28896, 11, 323, 9498, 50127, 13, 71715, 311, 2997, 264, 48713, 315, 8146, 389, 701, 12235, 311, 6106, 499, 2351, 3794, 264, 2134, 315, 7718, 37493, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 17, 25, 54804, 349, 4497, 18317, 61439, 96350, 1035, 55747, 6108, 15657, 527, 9257, 304, 24722, 11, 46192, 11, 323, 34072, 11, 323, 649, 1520, 8108, 701, 5326, 315, 21249, 19338, 1093, 4851, 8624, 323, 20335, 13, 9934, 52913, 810, 6136, 6108, 21644, 11, 1778, 439, 77852, 11, 23935, 2269, 4108, 11, 323, 48438, 22235, 63452, 11, 1139, 701, 10173, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 18, 25, 10573, 4718, 5896, 290, 71282, 1035, 36, 1113, 3544, 19885, 649, 3063, 311, 35208, 810, 25247, 1109, 499, 1205, 11, 902, 649, 17210, 311, 4785, 8895, 323, 1023, 2890, 5435, 13, 11728, 6666, 311, 13788, 12562, 323, 2585, 701, 19885, 311, 10519, 264, 9498, 4785, 323, 8108, 701, 5326, 315, 21249, 19338, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 19, 25, 29108, 8773, 291, 323, 14114, 3359, 40160, 1035, 83635, 323, 47237, 15657, 527, 3629, 1579, 304, 3779, 70913, 11, 12290, 11, 323, 53808, 50127, 11, 902, 649, 5376, 701, 5326, 315, 21249, 19338, 13, 9934, 311, 4017, 701, 15652, 315, 1521, 15657, 323, 3469, 369, 4459, 11, 653, 35122, 15657, 4619, 382, 334, 16394, 220, 20, 25, 29837, 10320, 3696, 660, 1035, 9023, 16113, 3403, 3090, 374, 7718, 369, 8244, 2890, 11, 323, 649, 1520, 449, 4785, 4814, 11, 74502, 11, 323, 4907, 5990, 13, 71715, 311, 7172, 520, 3325, 8223, 29247, 315, 3090, 824, 1938, 11, 323, 5766, 31705, 661, 21662, 1093, 39962, 323, 23661, 430, 649, 617, 83