erved with rice and miso soup.\n11. Okonomiyaki: A savory pancake made with batter, cabbage, and various fillings such as pork, seafood, or vegetables.\n12. Takoyaki: A popular street food in Japan, made with crispy batter filled with diced octopus, green onion, and tempura bits.\n13. Matcha ice cream: A unique and popular dessert made with green tea-flavored ice cream.\n14. Mochi: Soft, chewy rice cakes often filled with red bean paste, ice cream, or fruit.\n15. Teriyaki chicken: Grilled or pan-fried chicken glazed with a sweet soy sauce-based sauce.\n\nThese are just a few examples of the many delicious foods you can find in Japan. Enjoy exploring the world of Japanese cuisine!', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 1160, 315, 5526, 3691, 3673, 304, 6457, 1473, 16, 13, 328, 38174, 25, 362, 11670, 11002, 12269, 1903, 449, 30050, 70, 1636, 20228, 323, 5370, 90771, 11, 1778, 439, 7257, 7795, 11, 24822, 11, 323, 53405, 627, 17, 13, 15504, 268, 25, 362, 5526, 11002, 46895, 273, 19724, 12269, 1903, 449, 36167, 477, 16553, 45993, 11, 34153, 61260, 11, 323, 5370, 90771, 627, 18, 13, 20539, 5808, 25, 426, 22688, 323, 5655, 2269, 4588, 53405, 477, 24822, 11, 3629, 10434, 449, 264, 3185, 315, 20228, 323, 86921, 19737, 627, 19, 13, 71968, 94457, 25, 2895, 4473, 16553, 41643, 388, 11, 3629, 88340, 449, 12290, 477, 2024, 16618, 14966, 19737, 627, 20, 13, 549, 15357, 25, 362, 955, 315, 11002, 46895, 273, 1903, 505, 34153, 20415, 11, 3629, 10434, 304, 264, 4106, 45993, 477, 449, 86921, 19737, 627, 21, 13, 328, 27931, 25, 70722, 11, 22786, 86, 20559, 61260, 3629, 10434, 9439, 477, 304, 264, 4106, 45993, 627, 22, 13, 31816, 74, 51843, 25, 362, 16385, 291, 323, 5655, 2269, 4588, 36167, 4018, 1169, 11, 3629, 10434, 449, 75220, 74873, 323, 20228, 627, 23, 13, 1952, 343, 21336, 25, 12639, 4328, 35831, 20228, 20953, 10409, 449, 75057, 11, 41420, 11, 477, 3820, 839, 42272, 627, 24, 13, 386, 15782, 19724, 25, 362, 8776, 11002, 19724, 1903, 449, 5906, 78, 25982, 11, 80247, 11, 323, 67329, 12320, 627