Output~2025-04-07 00:35:17.620743: [RequestOutput(request_id=1332, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate questions that will help a customer determine their desired outcome. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 4860, 430, 690, 1520, 264, 6130, 8417, 872, 12974, 15632, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here are some questions that can help a customer determine their desired outcome:\n\n**Product/Service Selection**\n\n1. What is the primary purpose of your purchase? (e.g., for personal use, for a business, for a specific project)\n2. What are your top priorities for this product or service? (e.g., price, quality, features, brand reputation)\n3. Are you looking for a specific type of product or service (e.g., software, hardware, consulting, training)?\n4. Do you have a specific budget in mind for this purchase?\n5. Are there any specific features or functionalities you need this product or service to have?\n\n**Problem-Solving**\n\n1. What is the problem or challenge you're trying to solve with this product or service?\n2. How often do you encounter this problem or challenge?\n3. What are the consequences of not solving this problem or challenge?\n4. Have you tried any solutions in the past? If so, what were the results?\n5. What is your ideal outcome for solving this problem or challenge?\n\n**Goals and Objectives**\n\n1. What are your short-term and long-term goals related to this product or service?\n2. How does this product or service align with your overall business or personal goals?\n3. Are there any specific metrics or Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) you're trying to improve?\n4. Are there any regulatory or compliance requirements you need to meet?\n5. Are there any specific timelines or deadlines you need to meet?\n\n**User Experience**\n\n1. How will you be using this product or service (e.g., daily, occasionally, for a specific project)?\n2. What is your preferred method of interaction with the product or service (e.g., online, in-person, phone, email)?\n3. Are there any specific user interface or user experience requirements you have?\n4. Are there any specific integrations or compatibility requirements you need?\n5. Are there any specific support or training needs you have?\n\nBy asking these questions, you can help customers clarify their desired outcome and provide a more tailored solution that meets their needs and expectations.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 1063, 4860, 430, 649, 1520, 264, 6130, 8417, 872, 12974, 15632, 1473, 334, 4921, 14, 1898, 25117, 57277, 16, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 6156, 7580, 315, 701, 7782, 30, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 369, 4443, 1005, 11, 369, 264, 2626, 11, 369, 264, 3230, 2447, 340, 17, 13, 3639, 527, 701, 1948, 30601, 369, 420, 2027, 477, 2532, 30, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 3430, 11, 4367, 11, 4519, 11, 6883, 17444, 340, 18, 13, 8886, 499, 3411, 369, 264, 3230, 955, 315, 2027, 477, 2532, 320, 68, 1326, 2637, 3241, 11, 12035, 11, 31831, 11, 4967, 87527, 19, 13, 3234, 499, 617, 264, 3230, 8199, 304, 4059, 369, 420, 7782, 5380, 20, 13, 8886, 1070, 904, 3230, 4519, 477, 93180, 499, 1205, 420, 2027, 477, 2532, 311, 617, 1980, 334, 32298, 6354, 20222, 57277, 16, 13, 3639, 374, 279, 3575, 477, 8815, 499, 2351, 4560, 311, 11886, 449, 420, 2027, 477, 2532, 5380, 17, 13, 2650, 3629, 656, 499, 13123, 420, 3575, 477, 8815, 5380, 18, 13, 3639, 527, 279, 16296, 315, 539, 22581, 420, 3575, 477, 8815, 5380, 19, 13, 12522, 499, 6818, 904, 10105, 304, 279, 3347, 30, 1442, 779, 11, 1148