Output~2025-04-07 00:35:39.093549: [RequestOutput(request_id=1341, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Compose a letter of complaint to a company. ### Input: Product: Refrigerator\\nProblem: Developed rust on the door ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 1219, 2972, 264, 6661, 315, 12458, 311, 264, 2883, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 5761, 25, 75258, 859, 1734, 32298, 25, 80110, 23941, 389, 279, 6134, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="[Your Name]\n[Your Address]\n[City, State, ZIP]\n[Email Address]\n[Phone Number]\n[Date]\n\n[Company Name]\n[Company Address]\n[City, State, ZIP]\n\nDear Customer Service Team,\n\nI am writing to express my disappointment and frustration with my recent purchase of a [Brand Name] refrigerator, model [Model Number], which I acquired on [Date of Purchase]. Unfortunately, I have noticed that the door of my refrigerator has developed rust, which is not only unsightly but also raises concerns about the overall quality and durability of the product.\n\nI have taken good care of the refrigerator, ensuring that it is regularly cleaned and maintained according to the manufacturer's instructions. Despite this, I was shocked to discover the rust spots on the door, which have appeared within [Timeframe] of owning the product. I am extremely disappointed that a product from a reputable brand like [Brand Name] would have such a significant flaw.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could look into this matter and provide a solution to rectify the issue. I would like to request a replacement or a refund, whichever is feasible, as I do not feel that I should have to live with a product that is defective and potentially poses a risk to my health and safety.\n\nI have attached a photo of the rust spots on the door for your reference. I would appreciate a prompt response regarding the next steps to resolve this issue. If you require any additional information or would like to schedule a visit from a technician, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter. I look forward to hearing from you soon.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Your Name]", token_ids=[58, 7927, 4076, 933, 58, 7927, 9356, 933, 58, 13020, 11, 3314, 11, 57774, 933, 58, 4886, 9356, 933, 58, 7084, 5742, 933, 58, 1956, 2595, 58, 14831, 4076, 933, 58, 14831, 9356, 933, 58, 13020, 11, 3314, 11, 57774, 2595, 31765, 12557, 5475, 8068, 3638, 40, 1097, 4477, 311, 3237, 856, 41698, 323, 33086, 449, 856, 3293, 7782, 315, 264, 510, 28268, 4076, 60, 46044, 11, 1646, 510, 1747, 5742, 1145, 902, 358, 19426, 389, 510, 1956, 315, 32088, 948, 19173, 11, 358, 617, 14000, 430, 279, 6134, 315, 856, 46044, 706, 8040, 23941, 11, 902, 374, 539, 1193, 7120, 73048, 719, 1101, 25930, 10742, 922, 279, 8244, 4367, 323, 39665, 315, 279, 2027, 382, 40, 617, 4529, 1695, 2512, 315, 279, 46044, 11, 23391, 430, 433, 374, 15870, 28822, 323, 18908, 4184, 311, 279, 14290, 596, 11470, 13, 18185, 420, 11, 358, 574, 27718, 311, 7142, 279, 23941, 19300, 389, 279, 6134, 11, 902, 617, 9922, 2949, 510, 1489, 6906, 60, 315, 41377, 279, 2027, 13, 358, 1097, 9193, 25406, 430, 264, 2027, 505, 264, 56940, 6883, 1093, 510, 28268, 4076, 60, 1053, 617, 1778, 264, 5199, 26784, 382, 40, 1053, 15763, 433, 422, 499, 1436, 1427, 1139, 420, 5030, 323, 3493, 264, 6425, 311, 7763, 1463, 279, 4360, 13, 358, 1053, 1093, 311, 1715, 264, 14039, 477, 264, 21639, 11, 54784, 374, 43303, 11, 4