Output~2025-04-07 00:37:33.429478: [RequestOutput(request_id=1366, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Write a descriptive story about a bear going on a picnic. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 9842, 264, 53944, 3446, 922, 264, 11984, 2133, 389, 264, 55562, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="The sun was shining brightly in the forest, casting a warm glow over the lush green trees and the sparkling stream that ran through the heart of the woods. In a clearing surrounded by tall oaks and pines, a big, fluffy bear named Bert was busy preparing for a picnic. He had been looking forward to this day for weeks, and he was determined to make it a special one.\n\nBert had packed a basket with all his favorite foods: juicy berries, sweet honey, and crunchy nuts. He had even brought a special blanket to sit on, and a big, floppy hat to keep the sun out of his eyes. As he made his way to the clearing, the scent of fresh grass and wildflowers filled his nostrils, and he couldn't help but feel a sense of excitement and joy.\n\nAs he arrived at the clearing, Bert spread out his blanket and began to unpack his basket. He munched on a handful of berries while he arranged the food and drinks in a neat and tidy pattern. The sound of birds chirping and leaves rustling in the breeze filled the air, and Bert felt like he was in his own little paradise.\n\nJust as he was about to take a bite of his favorite snack, a squirrel scampered up a nearby tree, chattering and squeaking in a high-pitched voice. Bert laughed and waved at the squirrel, feeling grateful for the company. He offered the squirrel a few nuts, and the two of them sat together in the sun, munching on their snacks and enjoying the peaceful atmosphere.\n\nAs the afternoon wore on, Bert decided to take a walk through the forest, exploring the trails and taking in the sights and sounds of the natural world. He climbed over rocks and under low-hanging branches, feeling the rough bark of the trees beneath his paws. The scent of wildflowers and fresh earth filled his nostrils, and he felt a sense of contentment wash over him.\n\nAs the sun began to set, Bert made his way back to his blanket, where he settled in for a cozy nap. The sound of the stream babbling in the distance lulled him to sleep, and he dreamed of all the wonderful things he would do on his next adventure.\n\nAs the stars began to twinkle in the sky, Bert woke up with a start, feeling refreshed and rejuvenated. He packed up his basket and blanket, and made his way back to his cozy little den, feeling grateful for the wonderful picnic he had just had. He curled up in his bed of leaves and drifted", token_ids=[791, 7160, 574, 49025, 76389, 304, 279, 13952, 11, 25146, 264, 8369, 37066, 927, 279, 58367, 6307, 12690, 323, 279, 64612, 4365, 430, 10837, 1555, 279, 4851, 315, 279, 33633, 13, 763, 264, 33850, 23712, 555, 16615, 297, 10011, 323, 281, 1572, 11, 264, 2466, 11, 68661, 11984, 7086, 51775, 574, 13326, 20646, 369, 264, 55562, 13, 1283, 1047, 1027, 3411, 4741, 311, 420, 1938, 369, 5672, 11, 323, 568, 574, 11075, 311, 1304, 433, 264, 3361, 832, 382, 33, 531, 1047, 19937, 264, 14351, 449, 682, 813, 7075, 15657, 25, 56153, 63494, 11, 10437, 26828, 11, 323, 95333, 31049, 13, 1283, 1047, 1524, 7263, 264, 3361, 39139, 311, 2503, 389, 11, 323, 264, 2466, 11, 92458, 9072, 311, 2567, 279, 7160, 704, 315, 813, 6548, 13, 1666, 568, 1903, 813, 1648, 311, 279, 33850, 11, 279, 41466, 315, 7878, 16763, 323, 8545, 89770