s right, please let me know.\n\n**Closing:**\n\nThank you for calling [Company Name]. I appreciate your patience and understanding. If you have any further questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to reach out. Have a great day!\n\n**Additional Tips:**\n\n* Always listen actively and empathetically to the customer's concerns.\n* Take detailed notes and summarize the issue to ensure understanding.\n* Be patient and professional, even in difficult situations.\n* Offer solutions and alternatives when possible.\n* Follow up with the customer to ensure the issue is resolved to their satisfaction.\n\nRemember to tailor the script to your company's specific products or services, and to always prioritize the customer's needs and concerns.", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 6205, 4641, 5429, 369, 264, 6130, 2532, 18740, 1473, 334, 7084, 14025, 25, 57277, 334, 38255, 25, 57277, 9906, 11, 9901, 499, 369, 8260, 510, 14831, 4076, 948, 3092, 836, 374, 510, 7927, 4076, 1145, 323, 358, 3358, 387, 6380, 311, 7945, 499, 449, 904, 4860, 477, 10742, 499, 1253, 617, 13, 3053, 499, 4587, 3371, 757, 264, 2697, 2766, 922, 1148, 12716, 499, 311, 1650, 603, 3432, 1980, 334, 38, 1894, 8245, 25, 57277, 6854, 499, 4587, 3493, 757, 449, 701, 836, 323, 279, 2015, 1396, 477, 2759, 1396, 5938, 449, 701, 4360, 30, 1115, 690, 1520, 757, 2731, 7945, 499, 382, 334, 16648, 2752, 279, 26292, 25, 57277, 6854, 499, 4587, 7664, 279, 4360, 499, 2351, 25051, 30, 3639, 5084, 311, 387, 279, 3575, 11, 323, 1268, 706, 433, 11754, 499, 1980, 334, 91635, 65, 51340, 25, 57277, 40, 4265, 1093, 311, 1520, 499, 20498, 97508, 279, 4360, 13, 3053, 499, 4587, 1456, 510, 4302, 3230, 69771, 7504, 51064, 12522, 499, 6818, 510, 4302, 3230, 69771, 7504, 60, 1980, 334, 39206, 25, 57277, 40, 3619, 430, 510, 4302, 8830, 315, 279, 4360, 948, 358, 2846, 2133, 311, 656, 856, 1888, 311, 9006, 420, 4360, 369, 499, 13, 510, 14099, 11175, 477, 6425, 948, 2209, 1070, 4205, 775, 358, 649, 656, 311, 1520, 1980, 334, 12763, 5352, 25, 57277, 3