Output~2025-04-07 00:41:07.859326: [RequestOutput(request_id=1454, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Describe the taste of a dish made of beef, peppers, and onions. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 61885, 279, 12945, 315, 264, 12269, 1903, 315, 25309, 11, 58573, 11, 323, 45697, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="The dish I'm describing is a savory and flavorful beef stir-fry made with tender chunks of beef, crunchy bell peppers, and caramelized onions. The first bite transports me to a world of rich and meaty goodness, with the beef's natural sweetness and umami flavors taking center stage. The beef is cooked to perfection, with a nice char on the outside and a tender, juicy interior that just melts in your mouth.\n\nAs I chew, the sweetness of the bell peppers kicks in, adding a pop of freshness and crunch to the dish. The peppers are slightly smoky from being sautéed with a hint of oil, which adds depth and complexity to the flavor profile. Meanwhile, the caramelized onions bring a sweet and savory element to the dish, their natural sugars having been coaxed out by the cooking process.\n\nAs the flavors meld together, I'm struck by the perfect balance of sweet, savory, and umami notes. The beef, peppers, and onions work together in harmony, creating a dish that's both comforting and exciting. Each bite is a delight, with the flavors dancing on my palate and leaving me wanting more.", token_ids=[791, 12269, 358, 2846, 23524, 374, 264, 94760,