Output~2025-04-07 00:41:52.225155: [RequestOutput(request_id=1476, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: List the most common properties of a hologram. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 1796, 279, 1455, 4279, 6012, 315, 264, 72927, 2453, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here are the most common properties of a hologram:\n\n1. **Three-Dimensional Image**: A hologram is a three-dimensional image that appears to be floating in space, giving the illusion of depth and volume.\n2. **Interference Pattern**: Holograms are created by recording the interference pattern of light waves that have interacted with an object. This interference pattern is what allows the hologram to reconstruct the object's image.\n3. **Diffraction**: Holograms diffract light, meaning that they bend light around them, creating the illusion of a three-dimensional image.\n4. **Reconstructibility**: Holograms can be reconstructed by shining laser light on them, which allows the image to appear in mid-air.\n5. **Parallax**: Holograms exhibit parallax, meaning that the image appears to shift when viewed from different angles, just like a real object would.\n6. **Depth Cueing**: Holograms use depth cueing, such as perspective and shading, to create the illusion of depth and distance.\n7. **Color**: Holograms can display a range of colors, depending on the materials used to create them.\n8. **Size**: Holograms can be created in a range of sizes, from small to large, depending on the technology used.\n9. **Portability**: Holograms can be easily transported and displayed, making them a popular choice for exhibitions and displays.\n10. **Interactivity**: Holograms can be interactive, allowing viewers to manipulate and engage with the image in various ways.\n\nThese properties make holograms a unique and captivating form of visual display that can be used in a variety of applications, from entertainment to education and beyond.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 279, 1455, 4279, 6012, 315, 264, 72927, 2453, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 20215, 9607, 29321, 4758, 96618, 362, 72927, 2453, 374, 264, 2380, 33520, 2217, 430, 8111, 311, 387, 19596, 304, 3634, 11, 7231, 279, 41919, 315, 8149, 323, 8286, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 3386, 2251, 19365, 96618, 473, 1640, 95801, 527, 3549, 555, 14975, 279, 32317, 5497, 315, 3177, 17301, 430, 617, 16681, 291, 449, 459, 1665, 13, 1115, 32317, 5497, 374, 1148, 6276, 279, 72927, 2453, 311, 44928, 279, 1665, 596, 2217, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 22499, 16597, 96618, 473, 1640, 95801, 1422, 1658, 533, 3177, 11, 7438, 430, 814, 37920, 3177, 2212, 1124, 11, 6968, 279, 41919, 315, 264, 2380, 33520, 2217, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 697, 7750, 3225, 96618, 473, 1640, 95801, 649, 387, 83104, 555, 49025, 21120, 3177, 389, 1124, 11, 902, 6276, 279, 2217, 311, 5101, 304, 5209, 38635, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 4368, 45268, 96618, 473, 1640, 95801, 31324, 1370, 45268, 11, 7438, 430, 279, 2217, 8111, 311, 6541, 994, 19894, 505, 2204, 27030, 11, 1120, 1093, 264, 1972, 1665, 1053, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 20361, 97994, 287, 96618, 473, 1640, 95801, 1005, 8149, 50498, 287, 11, 1778, 439, 13356, 323, 72834, 11, 311, 1893, 279, 41919, 315, 8149, 323, 6138, 627, 22, 13, 3146, 1668, 96618, 473, 1640, 95801, 649, 3113, 264, 2134, 315, 8146, 11, 11911, 389, 279, 7384, 1511, 311, 1893, 1124, 627, 23, 13, 3146, 1730, 96618, 473, 1640, 95801, 649, 387, 3549, 304, 264, 2134, 315, 12562, 11, 505, 2678, 311, 3544, 11, 11911, 389, 279, 5557, 1511, 627, 24, 13, 3146, 7229, 2968, 96618, 473, 1640, 95801, 