Output~2025-04-07 00:44:46.842461: [RequestOutput(request_id=1537, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Design a 3-step process to learn a new language. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 7127, 264, 220, 18, 30308, 1920, 311, 4048, 264, 502, 4221, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here is a 3-step process to learn a new language:\n\n**Step 1: Set Your Foundation (Weeks 1-2)**\n\n* Start by setting your goals and motivation for learning the new language. Identify why you want to learn the language and what you want to achieve.\n* Learn the basic phrases and vocabulary, such as greetings, introductions, and common expressions. You can use language learning apps like Duolingo, Babbel, or Rosetta Stone to get started.\n* Familiarize yourself with the language's grammar rules, such as verb conjugation, sentence structure, and pronunciation.\n\n**Step 2: Immerse Yourself in the Language (Weeks 3-6)**\n\n* Listen to native speakers and try to mimic their pronunciation. Watch TV shows, movies, or videos in the target language with English subtitles.\n* Practice speaking and listening by engaging in conversations with native speakers, either in person or online. You can use language exchange websites like italki or Conversation Exchange.\n* Read books, articles, or news in the target language to improve your reading comprehension.\n\n**Step 3: Refine Your Skills (Weeks 7-12)**\n\n* Focus on refining your grammar and vocabulary by practicing with more complex texts, such as news articles, essays, or short stories.\n* Engage in conversations with native speakers regularly, either in person or online, to improve your speaking and listening skills.\n* Use flashcards or language learning apps to review and reinforce new vocabulary and grammar rules.\n\nRemember, learning a language takes time and practice. Stay consistent, persistent, and patient, and you'll be well on your way to becoming proficient in your new language!", token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 220, 18, 30308, 1920, 311, 4048, 264, 502, 4221, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 2638, 4718, 5114, 320, 17490, 82, 220, 16, 12, 17, 33395, 271, 9, 5256, 555, 6376, 701, 9021, 323, 25835, 369, 6975, 279, 502, 4221, 13, 65647, 3249, 499, 1390, 311, 4048, 279, 4221, 323, 1148, 499, 1390, 311, 11322, 627, 9, 15281, 279, 6913, 32847, 323, 36018, 11, 1778, 439, 95185, 11, 6111, 5247, 11, 323, 4279, 24282, 13, 1472, 649, 1005, 4221, 6975, 10721, 1093, 16062, 337, 29008, 11, 26441, 9978, 11, 477, 16870, 27625, 14637, 311, 636, 3940, 627, 9, 34701, 9730, 553, 6261, 449, 279, 4221, 596, 32528, 5718, 11, 1778, 439, 19120, 64380, 367, 11, 11914, 6070, 11, 323, 71722, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 2417, 1195, 325, 60005, 304, 279, 11688, 320, 17490, 82, 220, 18, 12, 21, 33395, 271, 9, 33249, 311, 10068, 22032, 323, 1456, 311, 56459, 872, 71722, 13, 10573, 6007, 5039, 11, 9698, 11, 477, 6946, 304, 279, 2218, 4221, 449, 6498, 67766, 627, 9, 28082, 12365, 323, 14624, 555, 23387, 304, 21633, 449, 10068, 22032, 11, 3060, 304, 1732, 477, 2930, 13, 1472, 649, 1005, 4221, 9473, 13335, 1093, 433, 1727, 72, 477, 51930, 19224, 627, 9, 4557, 6603, 11, 9908, 11, 477, 3754, 304, 279, 2218, 4221, 311, 7417, 701, 5403, 62194, 382, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 8718, 483, 4718, 31340, 320, 17490, 82, 220, 22, 12, 717, 33395, 271, 9, 26891, 389, 74285, 701, 32528, 323, 36018, 555, 36666, 449, 810, 6485, 22755, 11, 1778, 439, 3754, 9908, 11, 23691, 11, 477, 2875, 7493, 627, 9, 3365, 425, 304, 21633, 449, 10068, 220