Output~2025-04-07 00:45:43.963708: [RequestOutput(request_id=1570, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: List five traits of successful people. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 1796, 4330, 25022, 315, 6992, 1274, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Based on various studies and research, here are five traits that are commonly associated with successful people:\n\n1. **Resilience**: Successful individuals are often able to bounce back from setbacks, failures, and rejections. They have a strong ability to adapt to changing circumstances and maintain a positive attitude in the face of adversity.\n2. **Goal-Oriented**: Successful people are clear about their goals and are focused on achieving them. They set specific, measurable, and achievable targets, and they are willing to work hard to reach them.\n3. **Self-Awareness**: Successful individuals have a high level of self-awareness, which enables them to understand their strengths, weaknesses, and emotions. This self-awareness helps them to make informed decisions and to develop strategies for personal and professional growth.\n4. **Adaptability**: Successful people are able to adapt quickly to new situations, technologies, and ideas. They are open-minded and willing to learn from others, and they are not afraid to pivot when circumstances change.\n5. **Positive Attitude**: Successful individuals have a positive attitude and a growth mindset. They believe that their abilities and intelligence can be developed through hard work, dedication, and persistence. They are optimistic, enthusiastic, and motivated to achieve their goals.\n\nThese traits are not exhaustive, and there may be other characteristics that are also important for success. However, these five traits are commonly cited as essential for achieving success in various areas of life.', token_ids=[29815, 389, 5370, 7978, 323, 3495, 11, 1618, 527, 4330, 25022, 430, 527, 17037, 5938, 449, 6992, 1274, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 1079, 321, 1873, 96618, 46626, 7931, 527, 3629, 3025, 311, 34782, 1203, 505, 97737, 11, 28950, 11, 323, 312, 25593, 13, 2435, 617, 264, 3831, 5845, 311, 10737, 311, 10223, 13463, 323, 10519, 264, 6928, 19451, 304, 279, 3663, 315, 90930, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 41092, 24540, 13283, 291, 96618, 46626, 1274, 527, 2867, 922, 872, 9021, 323, 527, 10968, 389, 32145, 1124, 13, 2435, 743, 3230, 11, 66303, 11, 323, 89253, 11811, 11, 323, 814, 527, 10032, 311, 990, 2653, 311, 5662, 1124, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 12363, 6830, 1698, 2136, 96618, 46626, 7931, 617, 264, 1579, 2237, 315, 659, 66104, 2136, 11, 902, 20682, 1124, 311, 3619, 872, 36486, 11, 44667, 11, 323, 21958, 13, 1115, 659, 66104, 2136, 8779, 1124, 311, 1304, 16369, 11429, 323, 311, 2274, 15174, 369, 4443, 323, 6721, 6650, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 2654, 2756, 2968, 96618, 46626, 1274, 527, 3025, 311, 10737, 6288, 311, 502, 15082, 11, 14645, 11, 323, 6848, 13, 2435, 527, 1825, 34423, 323, 10032, 311, 4048, 505, 3885, 11, 323, 814, 527, 539, 16984, 311, 27137, 994, 13463, 2349, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 36590, 7867, 3993, 96618, 46626, 7931, 617, 264, 6928, 19451, 323, 264, 6650, 40543, 13, 2435, 4510, 430, 872, 18000, 323, 11478, 649, 387, 8040, 1555, 2653, 990, 11, 39955, 11, 323, 42056, 13, 2435, 527, 37036, 11, 42702, 11, 323, 27762, 311, 11322, 872, 9021, 382, 9673, 25022, 527, 539, 73603, 11, 323, 1070, 1253, 387, 1023, 17910, 430, 527, 1101, 3062, 369, 2450, 13, 4452, 11, 1521, 4330, 25022, 527, 17037, 22628, 439, 7718, 369, 32145, 2450, 304, 5370, 5789, 315