Output~2025-04-07 00:46:21.794515: [RequestOutput(request_id=1591, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Explain the three basic tenants of traditional Buddhism. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 83017, 279, 2380, 6913, 41016, 315, 8776, 61324, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here is a response that explains the three basic tenets of traditional Buddhism:\n\nIn traditional Buddhism, there are three basic tenets that form the foundation of the religion. These tenets are known as the "Three Jewels" or "Three Refuges," and they are:\n\n1. **The Buddha**: The first tenet is the Buddha, who is considered the teacher and guide. This refers to Siddhartha Gautama, a historical figure who is believed to have achieved enlightenment and taught others how to do the same. The Buddha is seen as a role model and a source of wisdom, and Buddhists seek to follow in his footsteps by cultivating wisdom, compassion, and mindfulness.\n2. **The Dharma**: The second tenet is the Dharma, which refers to the teachings of the Buddha. The Dharma is the path to enlightenment, and it is the set of principles and practices that Buddhists follow to achieve spiritual growth and liberation. The Dharma includes the Four Noble Truths, the Eightfold Path, and other teachings that help individuals develop wisdom, ethics, and mindfulness.\n3. **The Sangha**: The third tenet is the Sangha, which refers to the community of Buddhists who practice together and support one another on the path to enlightenment. The Sangha provides a sense of belonging and connection, and it offers a supportive environment for individuals to cultivate their spiritual practice. The Sangha is often seen as a source of wisdom, guidance, and inspiration, and it plays an important role in the Buddhist tradition.\n\nIn summary, the three basic tenets of traditional Buddhism are the Buddha (the teacher), the Dharma (the teachings), and the Sangha (the community). These three elements are interconnected and interdependent, and they provide a framework for individuals to cultivate wisdom, compassion, and spiritual growth.', token_ids=[8586, 374, 264, 2077, 430, 15100, 279, 2380, 6913, 5899, 1441, 315, 8776, 61324, 1473, 644, 8776, 61324, 11, 1070, 527, 2380, 6913, 5899, 1441, 430, 1376, 279, 16665, 315, 279, 13901, 13, 4314, 5899, 1441, 527, 3967, 439, 279, 330, 20215, 8117, 2053, 1, 477, 330, 20215, 8718, 51259, 1359, 323, 814, 527, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 791, 46054, 96618, 578, 1176, 5899, 295, 374, 279, 46054, 11, 889, 374, 6646, 279, 11326, 323, 8641, 13, 1115, 19813, 311, 85813, 13279, 23218, 96154, 3105, 11, 264, 13970, 7216, 889, 374, 11846, 311, 617, 17427, 81869, 323, 15972, 3885, 1268, 311, 656, 279, 1890, 13, 578, 46054, 374, 3970, 439, 264, 3560, 1646, 323, 264, 2592, 315, 24278, 11, 323, 50618, 1705, 6056, 311, 1833, 304, 813, 60802, 555, 99139, 24278, 11, 30481, 11, 323, 71705, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 791, 423, 78338, 96618, 578, 2132, 5899, 295, 374, 279, 423, 78338, 11, 902, 19813, 311, 279, 45572, 315, 279, 46054, 13, 578, 423, 78338, 374, 279, 1853, 311, 81869, 11, 323, 433, 374, 279, 743, 315, 16565, 323, 12659, 430, 50618, 1705, 1833, 311, 11322, 18330, 6650, 323, 55633, 13, 578, 423, 78338, 5764, 279, 13625, 49687, 30198, 82, 11, 279, 36944, 20557, 8092, 11, 323, 1023, 45572, 430, 1520, 7931, 2274, 24278, 11, 32008, 11, 323, 71705, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 791, 52022, 4317, 96618, 578, 4948, 5899, 295, 374, 279, 52022, 4317, 11, 902, 19813, 311, 279, 4029, 315, 50618,