Output~2025-04-07 00:48:55.854766: [RequestOutput(request_id=1643, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: What are the main characters in the Harry Potter books? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 3639, 527, 279, 1925, 5885, 304, 279, 14253, 30427, 6603, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="The main characters in the Harry Potter book series by J.K. Rowling are:\n\n1. **Harry Potter**: The protagonist of the series, a young wizard who attends Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry and embarks on a journey to defeat the dark wizard Lord Voldemort.\n2. **Hermione Granger**: Harry's best friend and a brilliant student at Hogwarts, known for her quick thinking and resourcefulness.\n3. **Ron Weasley**: Harry's best friend and a member of the Weasley family, a loving and loyal group of wizards.\n4. **Lord Voldemort**: The main antagonist of the series, a dark wizard who seeks to dominate the wizarding world and destroy all non-magical people.\n5. **Albus Dumbledore**: The wise and powerful headmaster of Hogwarts, who plays a significant role in guiding Harry on his journey.\n6. **Severus Snape**: A complex and conflicted character who is initially portrayed as a villain but is later revealed to be a complex and ultimately heroic figure.\n7. **Ginny Weasley**: Ron's younger sister and a talented witch who becomes a key player in the story.\n8. **Luna Lovegood**: A gentle and eccentric student at Hogwarts who becomes a close friend of Harry's.\n9. **Neville Longbottom**: A Gryffindor student who starts off as a shy and awkward boy but grows into a brave and powerful wizard.\n10. **Draco Malfoy**: A Slytherin student and Harry's rival, who is initially portrayed as a bully but is later revealed to be a complex and conflicted character.\n\nThese characters, along with many others, drive the plot and themes of the Harry Potter series, which explores themes of friendship, love, prejudice, and the struggle between good and evil.", token_ids=[791, 1925, 5885, 304, 279, 14253, 30427, 2363, 4101, 555, 622, 11606, 13, 96607, 527, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 42398, 30427, 96618, 578, 46684, 315, 279, 4101, 11, 264, 3995, 35068, 889, 75112, 78253, 6150, 315, 39450, 7868, 323, 39487, 894, 323, 8126, 7341, 389, 264, 11879, 311, 18506, 279, 6453, 35068, 10425, 81791, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 39, 4289, 6473, 2895, 4091, 96618, 14253, 596, 1888, 4333, 323, 264, 20333, 5575, 520, 78253, 11, 3967, 369, 1077, 4062, 7422, 323, 5211, 31514, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 54925, 1226, 74111, 96618, 14253, 596, 1888, 4333, 323, 264, 4562, 315, 279, 1226, 74111, 3070, 11, 264, 21955, 323, 29947, 1912, 315, 89263, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 52182, 81791, 96618, 578, 1925, 82159, 315, 279, 4101, 11, 264, 6453, 35068, 889, 26737, 311, 41836, 279, 35068, 287, 1917, 323, 7066, 682, 2536, 1474, 351, 950, 1274, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 2149, 10551, 82083, 96618, 578, 24219, 323, 8147, 2010, 13943, 315, 78253, 11, 889, 11335, 264, 5199, 3560, 304, 51346, 14253, 389, 813, 11879, 627, 21, 13, 3146, 1542, 424, 355, 86784, 96618, 362, 6485, 323, 9338, 6702, 3752, 889, 374, 15453, 45877, 439, 264, 40148, 719, 374, 3010, 10675, 311, 387, 264, 6485, 323, 13967, 56375, 7216, 627, 22, 13, 3146, 38, 258, 3919, 1226, 74111, 96618, 14662, 596, 14992, 13219, 323, 264, 23944, 37482, 889, 9221, 264, 1401, 2851, 304, 279, 3446, 627, 23, 13, 3146, 43, 8733, 10919, 19045, 96618, 362, 22443, 323, 55920, 5575, 520, 78253, 889, 9221, 264, 3345, 4333, 315, 14253, 596, 627, 24, 13, 3146, 45, 5230, 4618, 5843,