Output~2025-04-07 00:49:11.853330: [RequestOutput(request_id=1647, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: What are the main steps to writing an essay? ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 3639, 527, 279, 1925, 7504, 311, 4477, 459, 9071, 30, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text="Here are the main steps to writing an essay:\n\n**Step 1: Understand the Assignment**\n\n* Read and understand the prompt or question being asked\n* Identify the topic, purpose, and any specific requirements (e.g. word count, format, tone)\n\n**Step 2: Research and Plan**\n\n* Conduct research on the topic to gather information and ideas\n* Take notes and organize the information into categories or themes\n* Develop a thesis statement or main argument\n\n**Step 3: Create an Outline**\n\n* Determine the structure of the essay (e.g. introduction, body paragraphs, conclusion)\n* Break down the essay into smaller sections or paragraphs\n* Identify the main points to be covered in each section\n\n**Step 4: Write the Introduction**\n\n* Introduce the topic and provide background information\n* Provide a thesis statement or main argument\n* Grab the reader's attention with an interesting fact or anecdote\n\n**Step 5: Write the Body Paragraphs**\n\n* Write clear and concise paragraphs that support the thesis statement\n* Use evidence and examples to support the main points\n* Use transitional phrases to connect the paragraphs\n\n**Step 6: Write the Conclusion**\n\n* Summarize the main points made in the essay\n* Restate the thesis statement\n* Provide a final thought or call to action\n\n**Step 7: Edit and Revise**\n\n* Review the essay for content, structure, and grammar\n* Make revisions to improve clarity, coherence, and overall effectiveness\n* Check for plagiarism and ensure proper citation\n\n**Step 8: Proofread and Finalize**\n\n* Check for spelling, grammar, and punctuation errors\n* Make any final revisions\n* Format the essay according to the required style (e.g. MLA, APA, Chicago)\n\nBy following these steps, you can write a well-structured and effective essay that effectively communicates your ideas and arguments.", token_ids=[8586, 527, 279, 1925, 7504, 311, 4477, 459, 9071, 1473, 334, 8468, 220, 16, 25, 71994, 279, 35527, 57277, 9, 4557, 323, 3619, 279, 10137, 477, 3488, 1694, 4691, 198, 9, 65647, 279, 8712, 11, 7580, 11, 323, 904, 3230, 8670, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 3492, 1797, 11, 3645, 11, 16630, 696, 334, 8468, 220, 17, 25, 8483, 323, 9878, 57277, 9, 50935, 3495, 389, 279, 8712, 311, 9762, 2038, 323, 6848, 198, 9, 12040, 8554, 323, 31335, 279, 2038, 1139, 11306, 477, 22100, 198, 9, 8000, 264, 17850, 5224, 477, 1925, 5811, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 18, 25, 4324, 459, 53009, 57277, 9, 31001, 279, 6070, 315, 279, 9071, 320, 68, 1326, 13, 17219, 11, 2547, 43743, 11, 17102, 340, 9, 15996, 1523, 279, 9071, 1139, 9333, 14491, 477, 43743, 198, 9, 65647, 279, 1925, 3585, 311, 387, 9960, 304, 1855, 3857, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 19, 25, 9842, 279, 29438, 57277, 9, 1357, 48945, 279, 8712, 323, 3493, 4092, 2038, 198, 9, 40665, 264, 17850, 5224, 477, 1925, 5811, 198, 9, 37294, 279, 6742, 596, 6666, 449, 459, 7185, 2144, 477, 50750, 1295, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 20, 25, 9842, 279, 14285, 50451, 82, 57277, 9, 9842, 2867, 323, 64694, 43743, 430, 1862, 279, 17850, 5224, 198, 9, 5560, 6029, 323, 10507, 311, 1862, 279, 1925, 3585, 198, 9, 5560, 66743, 32847, 311, 4667, 279, 43743, 271, 334, 8468, 220, 21, 25, 9842, 279, 74977, 57277, 9, 8279, 5730, 553, 279, 1925, 3585,