ific department or function within an organization. They must develop and implement departmental strategies, manage budgets, and oversee the performance of their team members.\n\nThese are just a few examples of jobs that require strong leadership skills. There are many other roles that also require leadership abilities, such as sales managers, operations managers, and IT managers, to name a few.', token_ids=[8586, 527, 4330, 7032, 430, 11383, 1397, 3831, 11692, 7512, 1473, 16, 13, 3146, 79596, 14, 73718, 10783, 96618, 1666, 279, 8592, 72539, 11145, 304, 264, 2883, 477, 7471, 11, 264, 12432, 14, 73718, 10783, 374, 8647, 369, 3339, 19092, 11429, 11, 6376, 9021, 11, 323, 68704, 279, 8244, 5216, 315, 279, 7471, 627, 17, 13, 3146, 2087, 96618, 362, 6783, 374, 8647, 369, 6522, 264, 2128, 315, 8420, 11, 6376, 9021, 323, 26470, 11, 323, 23391, 430, 9256, 527, 8308, 30820, 323, 13750, 13, 2435, 2011, 1101, 62425, 323, 2274, 872, 2128, 3697, 311, 11322, 872, 2539, 4754, 627, 18, 13, 3146, 8006, 10790, 96618, 362, 2447, 6783, 374, 8647, 369, 9293, 11, 35821, 11, 323, 26991, 7224, 505, 1212, 311, 6381, 13, 2435, 2011, 3063, 264, 2128, 315, 2128, 3697, 11, 743, 58982, 11, 323, 6106, 430, 279, 2447, 374, 8308, 389, 892, 11, 2949, 8199, 11, 323, 311, 279, 2631, 4367, 10886, 627, 19, 13, 3146, 14939, 30982, 96618, 362, 2128, 3063, 374, 264, 5209, 11852, 7808, 889, 374, 8647, 369, 6522, 264, 2678, 2128, 315, 8420, 13, 2435, 2011, 3493, 19351, 11, 1862, 11, 323, 5216, 311, 872, 2128, 3697, 11, 323, 6106, 430, 814, 527, 3318, 3871, 13750, 311, 11322, 872, 9021, 627, 20, 13, 3146, 27725, 11452, 96618, 362, 9476, 2010, 374, 264, 10195, 7808, 889, 374, 8647, 369, 6522, 264, 3230, 9476, 477, 734, 2949, 459, 7471, 13, 2435, 2011, 2274, 323, 4305, 9476, 278, 15174, 11, 10299, 42484, 11, 323, 42003, 279, 5178, 315, 872, 2128, 3697, 382, 9673, 527, 1120, 264, 2478, 10507, 315, 7032, 430, 1397, 3831, 11692, 7512, 13, 2684, 527, 1690, 1023, 13073, 430, 1101, 1397, 11692, 18000, 11, 1778, 439, 