Output~2025-04-07 00:50:18.292871: [RequestOutput(request_id=1671, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Brainstorm four fun activities to do in spring. ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 31417, 27511, 3116, 2523, 7640, 311, 656, 304, 10683, 13, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='Here are four fun activities to do in spring:\n\n1. **Go on a nature scavenger hunt**: Spring is the perfect time to get outside and explore nature. Create a list of items to find, such as different types of flowers, leaves, or birds, and see who can spot the most items on the list.\n2. **Have a backyard picnic**: As the weather warms up, set up a blanket and some pillows in your backyard and have a picnic. You can bring out the grill and cook some burgers or hot dogs, or pack a basket with your favorite snacks and drinks.\n3. **Go on a bike ride or hike**: Spring is a great time to get some exercise and enjoy the beautiful scenery. Find a nearby trail or park and take a bike ride or hike to enjoy the blooming flowers and greenery.\n4. **Have a garden party**: Spring is the perfect time to start planting a garden, and what better way to celebrate than with a garden party? Invite some friends over and have a potluck where everyone brings a dish to share. You can also set up a DIY station where everyone can plant their own flowers or herbs to take home.\n\nI hope these ideas help you make the most of your spring!', token_ids=[8586, 527, 3116, 2523, 7640, 311, 656, 304, 10683, 14