Output~2025-04-07 00:50:41.174410: [RequestOutput(request_id=1679, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Prepare a budget for a camping trip ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 32266, 264, 8199, 369, 264, 33873, 8577, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**Camping Trip Budget**\n\n**Estimated Expenses:**\n\n1. **Transportation:**\n\t* Gas for the trip: $50\n\t* Parking fees: $10\n\t* Total: $60\n2. **Accommodation:**\n\t* Campsite fees: $30 per night (3 nights) = $90\n\t* Total: $90\n3. **Food and Beverages:**\n\t* Groceries for meals and snacks: $100\n\t* Cooking supplies (fuel, utensils, etc.): $20\n\t* Total: $120\n4. **Equipment and Gear:**\n\t* Tent: $20\n\t* Sleeping bag and pad: $30\n\t* Backpack: $20\n\t* Total: $70\n5. **Miscellaneous:**\n\t* Firewood: $10\n\t* Bug spray and sunscreen: $10\n\t* Total: $20\n\n**Total Estimated Cost:** $360\n\n**Notes:**\n\n* This budget assumes a 3-day camping trip with 2 people.\n* The cost of food and beverages can vary greatly depending on individual preferences and dietary needs.\n* The cost of equipment and gear can also vary depending on the quality and brand of the items.\n* This budget does not include any additional activities or expenses, such as hiking fees or guided tours.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n* Consider packing snacks and non-perishable food items to reduce food costs.\n* Bring reusable water bottles and containers to reduce waste and save money.\n* Consider sharing equipment and gear with fellow campers t