Output~2025-04-07 00:52:31.698307: [RequestOutput(request_id=1722, prompt="<|begin_of_text|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{'Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request. ### Instruction: Generate a creative product description of a <mask>. Make sure to include the features and benefits of the product. ### Input: Bluetooth Headset ### Response:'}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n", prompt_token_ids=[128000, 128000, 128006, 882, 128007, 271, 13922, 39314, 374, 459, 7754, 430, 16964, 264, 3465, 11, 35526, 449, 459, 1988, 430, 5825, 4726, 2317, 13, 9842, 264, 2077, 430, 36001, 45695, 279, 1715, 13, 17010, 30151, 25, 20400, 264, 11782, 2027, 4096, 315, 264, 366, 11508, 14611, 7557, 2771, 311, 2997, 279, 4519, 323, 7720, 315, 279, 2027, 13, 17010, 5688, 25, 24783, 11452, 751, 17010, 6075, 4989, 92, 128009, 128006, 78191, 128007, 271], encoder_prompt=None, encoder_prompt_token_ids=None, prompt_logprobs=None, outputs=[CompletionOutput(index=0, text='**Introducing the "SoundSphere" Bluetooth Headset - Elevate Your Audio Experience**\n\nImmerse yourself in crystal-clear sound with the "SoundSphere" Bluetooth Headset, designed to revolutionize your audio experience. This sleek and stylish headset is engineered to provide unparalleled comfort, exceptional sound quality, and seamless connectivity.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n* **Crystal-Clear Audio**: Enjoy rich, detailed sound with deep bass and crystal-clear highs, thanks to our proprietary audio technology that ensures a precise and immersive listening experience.\n* **Long-Lasting Battery Life**: With up to 12 hours of continuous playback, you can enjoy your favorite tunes, podcasts, or audiobooks without interruptions.\n* **Wireless Freedom**: Connect to your device via Bluetooth 5.0 and enjoy the freedom to move around without being tethered to your phone or computer.\n* **Comfortable Design**: Ergonomically designed ear cups and adjustable headband ensure a snug and comfortable fit, perfect for extended wear.\n* **Noise-Cancelling Technology**: Active noise-cancelling technology blocks out ambient noise, allowing you to focus on your music or calls.\n\n**Benefits:**\n\n* **Enhanced Productivity**: With the "SoundSphere" Bluetooth Headset, you can focus on your work or study without distractions, thanks to its noise-cancelling technology and comfortable design.\n* **Immersive Entertainment**: Experience your favorite movies, TV shows, or games with crystal-clear sound and immersive audio that draws you in.\n* **Hands-Free Convenience**: Take hands-free calls, control your music, and access your voice assistant with ease, all from the comfort of your ear.\n* **Travel-Friendly**: The "SoundSphere" Bluetooth Headset is lightweight and compact, making it the perfect travel companion for your next adventure.\n\n**Upgrade Your Audio Experience**\n\nExperience the "SoundSphere" Bluetooth Headset today and discover a world of crystal-clear sound, comfort, and convenience. Order now and take your audio experience to the next level!', token_ids=[334, 1090, 60637, 279, 330, 16493, 44059, 1, 24783, 11452, 751, 482, 55664, 349, 4718, 12632, 21460, 57277, 1453, 1195, 325, 6261, 304, 26110, 68127, 5222, 449, 279, 330, 16493, 44059, 1, 24783, 11452, 751, 11, 6319, 311, 14110, 553, 701, 7855, 3217, 13, 1115, 48494, 323, 32461, 50679, 374, 46036, 311, 3493, 71257, 6981, 11, 25363, 5222, 4367, 11, 323, 47970, 31357, 382, 334, 1622, 20289, 25, 57277, 9, 3146, 82038, 7813, 1576, 12632, 96618, 23485, 9257, 11, 11944, 5222, 449, 5655, 22253, 323, 26110, 68127, 54879, 11, 9523, 311, 1057, 34333, 7855, 5557, 430, 26420, 264, 24473, 323, 65280, 14624, 3217, 627, 9, 3146, 6720, 12, 5966, 287, 34712, 9601, 96618, 3161, 709, 311, 220, 717, 4207, 315, 19815, 33059, 11, 499, 649, 4774, 701, 7075, 55090, 11, 55346, 11, 477, 47468, 677, 15027, 2085, 89508, 627, 9, 3146, 3